<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="1KI" style="id">1 Kumpipate</book>
  <para style="h">1 Kumpipate</para>
  <para style="toc1">1 Kumpipate</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Kumpipate</para>
  <para style="mt">1 Kumpipate</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />David hong upata in, a hongtek mahmahta hi. Huchi in puan in a khuh zel ua, himahleh lum a sathei tuankei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A sikhate’n a kiang ah, “Ka toupa kumpipa adin nungak zong le ungla; Kumpipa kiang chin ah om gige henla, kem leh; na angsung ah honglum leh, ka toupa Kumpipa’n lum a honsa thei ding” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huchi in Israel gam tengteng ah nungak melhoih a zong ua, Shunam mi Abishag a va mu ua, Kumpipa kiang ah a pi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huai nungak a mel a hoih mahmah a, Kumpipa a kem a, a nektak a bawlsak hi. Himahleh, Kumpipa’n amah a kithuahpih kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Haggith tapa Adonijah in, “Kei Kumpipa a pang ding kei ve” chi in a kingai thupi mahmah hi. Kangtalai leh sakol tungtuang mi sawmnga a ma a tai dingte toh a kisa sak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Apan lah chiklai in leng, “Bangdia hichibang a hih na hia?” chi in a lungkham sak ngeikei hi. Amah melhoih mahmah a, Absalom sang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aman Zeruiah tapa Joab leh siampu Abiathar thu a dong a; amau Adonijah lam ah a pang ua, amah a panpih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Siampu Zadok, Jehoiada tapa Benaiah, zawlnei Nathan, Shimei, Rei leh David pawl a mihangsante bel Adonijah lam ah a pangkei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Adonijah in belamte, bawngtalte, ganvak thaute Zoheleth suang ah a gou a, huai bel En-rogel kiang chin a om ahi. Kumpipa tapate, a unau tengteng leh Judah gam a Kumpipa sikha tengteng a chial hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Zawlnei Nathan, Benaiah, mi hangsante leh a unaupa Solomon bel a chial kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nathan in Solomon nu Bathsheba kiang ah, “Haggith tapa Adonijah, i toupa David theihlouh in vaihawm in a om chih zalou na hi maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na bitna ding leh na tapa Solomon bitna ding k’on hilh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kumpipa David kiang ah valut inla, a kiang ah, Aw toupa, ka kumpipa, na sikhanu kiang ah na tapa Solomon, ka nung in a honglal ngeingei dia, amah ka mangtutphah ah a tu ding, chi in na kichiam ahi kei maw? Bang achia Adonijah in vaihawm ahia?” vachi dih a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Ngai in, Kumpipa na va houpih laitak in ken leng k’on zui lut sam dia, na thugen k’on hihkippih ding” chi in a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bathsheba Kumpipa kiang ah indan ah a valut a; Kumpipa a upa mahmahta a, Shunam mi Abishag in Kumpipa nektak a na bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bathsheba in Kumpipa kun in zahtakna a pia hi. Kumpipa’n, “Bang na deih a?” a na chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aman, “Ka toupa aw, Toupa na Pathian minlou in na sikhanu kiang ah, na tapa Solomon ka nung in a hong lal ngeingei ding, amah ka mangtutphah ah a hongtu ding, chi in na kichiam khinta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ngai in, tuin Adonijah lah a lal a; nang ka kumpipa toupa’n lah na theikei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Bawngtalte, ganvak thaute leh belamte a gou liapluap a, kumpipa tapa tengteng leh, siampu Abiathar leh sepaih heutu Joab a chial a, na sikha Solomon a chial kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huchi in, toupa aw, ka toupa nung a a mangtutphah a kua hong tu ding ahia chih na gen ding in, Israelte tengteng mit nang ka toupa kumpipa tung ah a tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huchilou in zaw hichi ahi ding a, toupa kumpipa a pute kiang a a ihmut sam hun chiang in, kei leh ka tapa Solomon thil hihkhial in a hon sepmai ding uh: a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ngai in, huchi a kumpipa a houpih laitak in, zawlnei Nathan a valut sam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“En dih, zawlnei Nathan a hong,” chi in kumpipa a hilh uh. Kumpipa kiang a vatun in, kumpipa ma ah a mai a leisi in a khupboh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nathan in, “Ka toupa, kumpipa aw, ka nung ah Adonijah a lal dia, ka mangtutphah ah a tu ding na chi maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuni in a kuansuk a, bawngtalte, ganvak thaute leh belamte a gou zengzung a, kumpipa tapa tengteng, sepaih heutute leh siampu Abiathar a chial hi. Ngai in, a ne un a dawnkhawm ua, Pathian in kumpipa Adonijah hondam hen, a chi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Himahleh kei na sikha ngei leh siampu Zadok, Jehoiada tapa Benaiah leh na sikha Solomon a hon chial kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hiai toupa ka kumpipa thu a hih a hih ngal leh toupa ka kumpipa’n a nung a mangtutphah a tu dingpa a kuapen ahia chih na sikhate na hilh nailou na hi ding maw?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Kumpipa David in a dawng a, Bathsheba hon sapsak dih ua, a chi hi. Kumpipa kiang ah a vahoh a, kumpipa ma ah a va ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Kumpipa a kichiam a, lungzinna tengteng a ka hinna humbitpa Toupa hinna lou in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Na kiang a Toupa Israelte Pathian minlou a, na tapa Solomon ka nung in a honglal ngeingei ding. Ka sik in ka mangtutphah ah a hong tu ding, chi a ka kichiam bang in, tuni in ka hih ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Bathsheba a mai a leisi in a khupboh a, kumpipa zahtakna pia in, “Ka toupa, kumpipa David tangtawn in damzel hen” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Kumpipa David in, “siampu Zadok leh zawlnei Nathan, Jehoiada tapa Benaiah hon va sapsak dih ua” a chi hi. Amau kumpipa ma ah a vapai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Kumpipa’n a kiang uah, “Na toupa uh sikhate pi unla, ka tapa Solomon keimah sabiltung mahmah ah tuangsak unla, Gihon ah pisuk un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Siampu Zadok leh zawlnei Nathan in Israelte kumpipa din thaunilh uhen. Pengkul mut unla, Pathian in kumpipa Solomon hondam hen, chi un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Huchi in amah na zuitou ding ua, ka mangtutphah ah a hong tu ding hi. Amah lah ka sik a lal ding ahi ngal a. Amah Israel gam leh Judah gam vaihawmtu dia ka seh ahi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Jehoiada tapa Benaiah in kumpipa a dawng a, “Amen, Toupa , ka toupa kumpipa Pathian in leng phasa hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Toupa ka toupa kumpipa kiang a a om bang in, Solomon kiang ah leng omsam henla, ka toupa kumpipa David mangtutphah sang in a mangtutphah hih thupizaw hen” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Huchi in, siampu Zadok, zawlnei Nathan, Jehoiada tapa Benaiah, Kereth mite leh Pelet mite a hohsuk ua, Solomon David sabiltung tung ah a tuangsak ua, Gihon ah a pi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Siampu Zadok in puanin apan thau koihna a la a, Solomon a nilh hi. Pengkul a mut ua, huchi in mi tengteng in, “Pathian in kumpipa Solomon hondam hen” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Mi tengteng in amah a zuitou ua, mite’n tamngaite a tum ua, a kipak mahmah ua, a husa ging un lei a kheng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Adonijah leh a michial, a kiang a om tengteng in Ankuang a lui khit un a za ua, Joab in pengkul mutging a zak in, “Khopi sung a husa ging zuazua bangchidan ahia leh?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Huai a chih laitak in, ngai in, siampu Abiathar tapa Jonathan a va hoh a, Adonijah in, “Hongpai dihve, nang zaw mi kizen na hi a, tanchinhoih na hontun mahmah ding” a na chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Jonathan in a dawng a, Adonijah kiang ah, “Tun keng e, toupa aw, kumpipa David in Solomon kumpipa in a bawlkhinta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Amah toh siampu Zadok, zawlnei Nathan, Jehoiada tapa Benaiah, Kereth mite leh Pelet mite kumpipa’n a sawl a, kumpipa sabiltung tung ah a tuangsak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Siampu Zadok leh zawlnei Nathan in Gihon ah kumpipa din thau a nilh uh. Huai apan nuamsatak in a paitou ua, huai in khopi sung a thawn zuazua hi. Husa na zak uh huai ahi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Huchi in Solomon leng lalgam tutphah ah a tuta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Kumpipa sikhate i toupa kumpipa David vualzawl din a hong ua, “Pathian in na min sang in Solomon min hihhoih zaw henla, na mangtutphah sang in a ma mangtutphah hih thupizaw hen” a hong chi uh. Huchi in kumpipa lupna tung ah a kun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Kumpipa’n leng, “ Toupa , Israelte Pathian, tuni mahmah a ka mangtutphah a tuding hon pepa phat in om hen. Ka mit mahmah in a muta,” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Adonijah mi chial tengteng in a lauta ua, a thou ua, a lampi chiat uah a paivekta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Adonijah in Solomon a lau a, a thou a, maitam ki a va len hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />“Ngai in, Adonijah in kumpipa Solomon a lau a; kumpipa Solomon in a sikha namsau a thatlou din ka kiang ah kichiam phot hen” chi in maitam ki a len hi chi’n Solomon a hilh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Solomon in, mi ginomtak a hih a suklat peuhmah leh a samzang khat leng lei ah a ke kei ding. Gitlouhna a nei chih theihna a om leh a si ding, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Huchi in kumpipa Solomon in mi a sawl a, maitam apan a va pisuk ua, a vahoh a, kumpipa Solomon ma ah a kun hi. Solomon inn a kiang ah, “Na in ah pai in” a na chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, David sihni ding a hong naita a; a tapa Solomon thu a pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Lei tengteng lampi ah ka pai sam dia; nang hattak leh pasalphatakin om in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na thilhih peuhmah leh na kiheina lam peuhmah a na lamzan theihna din Mosi dan a gelh a hih bang in, Toupa na Pathian in a lampite zui ding leh a thusehte, a thupiakte, a vaihawmte leh a thu theihsakte pom dia thu a piakte zui in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Toupa’n ka tungtang thu a, ‘Na suante’n a lungtang tengteng uleh a lungsim tak ua ka mitmuh a thutak a om ding a, a omdan ua a pilvan uleh Israelte mangtutphah a tu ding mi na tatlak kei ding, chi a a gen a hihkip ding hi.’ ”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Zeruiah tapa Joab in a hon bawldan, Israelte sepaih heutu nih Ner tapa Abner leh Jether tapa Amasa a bawldan na thei hi. Amaute a thah a, kileplai a kidou sisan suah a, a tai a kawnggak leh a khedap but a kidouna sisan a bansak dan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huchi in pha nasak dan bang in hih inla, a lu a kelsam pou han ah lungmuang tak in tumsak ken.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Gilead mi Barzillai tate tung ah hehpihna hihlang in. Na dohkan a an ummi din telsak in. Na unau Absalom apan ka taimang lai in ka kiang ah a hong ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ngai in Bahurim mi, Benjamin suan, Gera tapa Shimei na kiang ah a om hi. Aman Mahanaim a ka hohlai in hamse hoihlou pi a honloh khum hi. Himahleh Jordan ah hong dawn din a hong kuan hi. Huai ah, namsau in k’on that kei ding, chi in Toupa minlou in a kiang ah ka na kichiamta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huchi in mawhlou in zaw koih ken; Mi pil na hi ngal a. A tung ah bangchi’n na hihdia chih ahihleh na theimai ding. A lu a kelsam pou sisan toh han ah na tumsak ding ahi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />David bel a pute kiang ah a ihmu samta a, David khopi ah a vui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Israelte tung a David lal sung kum sawmli ahi. Hebron ah kum sagih a lal a, Jerusalem ah kum sawmthum leh thum a lal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Solomon a pa David mangtutphah ah a tu a; huchi in a gam nakpitak a hihkip in a hong omta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Haggith tapa Adonijah Solomon nu Bathsheba kiang ah a hoh a. Aman, “Hoih lam thu a hong na hi maw?” a na chi hi. Aman, “Hoihlam thu ah hi e” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Na kiang ah banghiam gen ding ka nei hi” a chi nawn a, aman, “Genve,” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aman, “Lalgam kei a ahita chih leh Israelte tengteng in leng kumpipa din kei a hon en gige uh chih na thei. Himahleh ka unaupa adin lalgam hei a om a, Toupa seh dan in ka unaupa a a hong hita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuin thil khat nget ding k’on nei a, hon nial ken” a chi hi. Aman a kiang ah, “Genve” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aman, “Hehpih in kumpipa Solomon hon houpihsak inla, na thu sellou ding ahi ngal a, Shunam mi Abishag zi din hon neisak in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bathsheba in, “Hileh a ke, kumpipa k’on na houpihsak ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Bathsheba in Adonijah adia kumpipa Solomon houpih din a kiang ah a hohta hi. Amah mu din kumpipa ading a, a ma ah a kun a, a mangtutphah ah a tuta hi. Kumpipa nu adin mangtutphah a koihsak a; a taklam ah a tuta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Thil neuchik khat k’on ngen ut hi. Hon nial mahmah ken, a chi hi. Kumpipa’n a kiang ah, “Nu ngenve” k’on phalsaklou kei ding“, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Aman, “Shunam mi Abishag na unaupa Adonijah zi din neisak in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kumpipa Solomon in a dawng a, a nu kiang ah, “Bangchidan a Shunam mi Abishag Adonijah adia ngen na hia oi? Gam leng ngetsak vanglak tan la; amah ka u a vo oi. Amah ading leh siampu Abiathar leh Zeruiah tapa Joab adin leng ngen tan la” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kumpipa Solomon in Toupa minlou in, “Adonijah thilnget in amah tung a sihna thu gen ahihkei himhim leh Pathian in a lohloh in honloh mai hen, huai sang a thupizaw in leng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Toupa , a thuchiam bang a hon hihkip, ka pa David mangtutphah a hon tusak, inkuan hon na phuhkhiak sakpa hinna lou in ka gen ahi. Adonijah tuni mahmah a sihsak ngeingei ding ahi” chi in a kichiamta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Huchi in, kumpipa Solomon in Jehoiada tapa Benaiah a sawl a, aman a vasual a, a thatta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Siampu Abiathar kiang ah kumpipa’n “Anathoth khua a na in leh lou ah pai in, sitak lah na hi ngal a. Himahleh ka pa David ma a Toupa Pathian bawm nana zawn zel ziak in leh ka pa haksatna thuak tengteng nana thuaksam zel ziak in, tuin zaw k’on that kei ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Huchi in, Solomon in Abiathar Toupa siampu a hihna a tawpsak hi. Hiai Toupa’n Shiloh a Eli inkuante tungtang thu a gen a tangtun theihna ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Huai thu Joab kiang a hongtung a, Joab Absalom lam ah a pang kei na a, Adonijah lam ah a pang hi. Joab Toupa puanin ah a tai a, maitam kite a len hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“ Toupa puanin ah Joab a tai a, ngai in, maitam bul ah a om” chi in kumpipa Solomon a hilh uhi. Kumpipa Solomon in Jehoiada tapa Benaiah, vasual in, chi in a sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Benaiah Toupa puanin ah a hohtou a, a kiang ah, “Kumpipa’n hong pawtkhia heh,” a chi, a chi hi. Aman, “Hilou e. Hiai ah ka si ding,” a chi hi. Benaiah in, “Joab in huchi in a hon na dawng hi” chi in kumpipa kiang ah thu a tun nawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Kumpipa’n a kiang ah, “A chih bang in hih inla, va sual inla, vui in, a ziak om hetlou a Joab in sisan a suahna apan kei leh ka pa inkawte na hulsak theihna din, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Amah sang a kizenzaw leh hoihzaw mi nih, Ner tapa Abner, Israelte sepaih heutu leh Jether tapa Amasa, Judahte sepaih heutu ka pa David theihlouh a sual a, namsaua a thah ziak in Toupa’n a sisan a lu tung ah a kiksak nawn ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />huaiziak in, a sisan uh Joab lu tung leh a suante lu tung ah tangtawn in a kiknawn dia; David leh a suante leh a inkawte leh a mangtutphah tung ah Toupa apan lungmuanna tangtawn in a om nilouh ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Huchi in, Jehoiada tapa Benaiah va hohtou in a vasual a, a thatta hi. Huchi in gamdai ah amah inn mah ah vui in a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Kumpipa’n Jehoiada tapa Benaiah sepaihte tung ah a sik in a pang sak hi. Siampu Zadok kumpipa’n Abiathar sik in a pangsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Kumpipa’n Shimei a samsaka, a kiang ah, “Jerusalem ah inn kilam inla huai ah teng inla, huai apan koi dangmah ah pawt ken.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Na pawt ni, Kidron lui na kan ni’n na si ngeingei ding chih thei in. Na sisan nangmah lu tung mah ah a om ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Shimei in kumpipa kiang ah, “A dik hi. Toupa ka kumpipa’n a gen bang in na sikha in a hihzel ding” a chi hi. Huchi in Shimei Jerusalem ah sawtkuam tak a teng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, kum thum nung in Shimei sikhate lak a nih, Gath kumpipa Maakah tapa Akish kiang ah a taimang uhi. “Ngai in, na sikhate Gath ah a om uh,” chi in Shimei a hilh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Shimei a thou a, a sabiltung a van a, a sikhate zongdin Gath a Akish kiang ah a hohta hi. Shimei in Gath apan a sikhate a vapi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Shimei Jerusalem apan a pawt a, Gath ah a hoh a, a hong kiknawn chi in Solomon a hilh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Kumpipa’n Shimei a samsaka, a kiang ah, “Na pawt ni, gam dang a na pawtkhiak ni’n na si ngeingei ding, chi in Toupa minlou a hon kichiam sak in, k’on theisak ahi kei maw? Nangmah in leng ka kiang ah, Na thugen ka zak a hoih hi, na chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Bangdia Toupa kichiamna leh k’on thupiak zuilou na hia?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Kumpipa mah in Shimei kiang ah, na lungtang sunggil a gitlouh dan, ka pa David tung a na gamtatdante na thei vek hi. Huchi in Toupa’n na gitlouhna nangmah lu tung ngei ah a kiksak nawn ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Kumpipa Solomon vualzawl in a om dia, David mangtutphah Toupa ma ah tangtawn in hihkip ahi ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Huchi in kumpipa’n Jehoiada tapa Benaiah thu a pia hi. Amah a kuan a, a vasual a, a thatta hi. Huchi in gam Solomon khut a hihkip in a omta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, Solomon in Aigupta kumpipa Pharo toh kizolhna a bawl hi. Pharo tanu a kitenpih a, amah inn leh Toupa inn a lamkhit ma leh Jerusalem kulh a umsuak masiah David khopi ah a omsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mipite kia munsangte ah a kithoih ua, huai ma in Toupa min adia inn a kilam nai takdih louh ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Solomon in Toupa a it a, a pa David thusehte a zui a; mun sangte a kithoih in, gimlimte kia a na hal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kumpipa kithoih din Gibeon khua ah a hoh hi. Huai lah mun sang poimawhtak ahi ngal a. Solomon in huai maitam tung ah haltum thillat sang khat a lan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Gibeon ah zan in Solomon kiang ah a mang in Toupa a hong kihil hi. Pathian in a kiang ah, “Ngen in, bang ahia k’on piak ding?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Solomon in, “Na sikha, ka pa David na mitmuh a thutak leh diktatna leh lungtang diktak pua a om bang in, nang a kiang ah hehpihna thupi mahmah na langsak hi. Nang hiai hehpihna thupi mahmah amah adin na guang a, nang a mangtutphah a tu ding tapa na pia a, tuni a a hongom petmah bang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aw Toupa , ka Pathian, Nang na sikha, ka pa David sik in kumpipa in n’on bawlta hi. Kei zaw naupang lel ka hi a; thu tunglam leh pawtlam leng ka theikei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na sikha, na mitelte, mi tampi, a tam ziak ua simseng vual louh leh a zah theihseng vuallouhte lak ah a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />huaiziak in, na mite vaihawmsak din na sikha theihsiamna lungtang pia in, huchi a a sia leh a pha ka khenkak theihna din. Na mi hiai zah zouzai kuan ahia vaihawm sak thei ding?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Solomon in huai ngen a, a thugen in Toupa a kipaksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pathian in a kiang ah, “Na damsawtna ding, nang adia hauhsaknate, na melmate sihna ding ngenlou a, vaihawm siamna dia theihsiamna na nget zawk ziak in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ngai in, na nget bang in ka hihta hi. Ngai in, pilna leh theihsiamna lungtang k’on pia hi. Huchi in, na ma ah nang bang kuamah a omkei ua, na nungchiang in leng nang bang kuamah a hong omkei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na nget louh, hauhsakna leh zahtakhuaina leng k’on pelai hi. Huchi in na damsung in kumpipate lak ah nang bang a omkei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na pa David in a zuih bang a ka thusehte leh ka thupiakte zui dia ka lampite a na pai leh k’on damsawt saklai ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Solomon a khanglou a, ngai in, mang a na hi. Huchi in Jerusalem ah a hoh a, Toupa thukhun bawm ma ah ading a, haltum thillat leh lemna thillatte a lan a, a sikhate tengteng adin Ankuang a lui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kizuak numei nih kumpipa kiang ah a hong ua, a ma ah a va ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Numei khat in, “Aw ka toupa, hiai numei toh inn khat a teng khawm ka hi ua; huai inn a amah toh ka omlai un nau ka nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, ka nau neih nung ni thum ni’n hiai numei in leng nau a neisam hi. Omkhawm ka hi ua; huai inn a om koute gellou, kuamah mikhual om a omkei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Zan in hiai numei ta a na si a; aman a delhlup khak ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Zanlai in a thou a, na sikhanu a ihmut kal in, ka sik a ka tapa a na la a, a pom a, a ma ta sipen ka ang ah a na sial hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Zingsang a ka ta nawi pedia ka thoh leh, ngai in, a na sikhin hi. Himahleh zingsang a ka etchet leh ngai in, ka suan ka tapa pen a na hi kei” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Numei dang in, “Hilou e. A hingpen ka tapa ahizaw, a sipen na tapa ahi” a chi hi. Khat in, “Hilou, a sipen na tapa ahi, a hingpen ka tapa ahi,” a chi chiltel hi. Huchibang in kumpipa ma ah a gen tuaktuak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kumpipa’n, “Khat in, a hingpen ka tapa ahi a, a sipen na tapa ahi,” a chi hi. Khat pen in, “Hilou, a sipen na tapa ahi, a hingpen ka tapa ahizaw, a chizel hi,” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kumpipa’n, “Namsau hon valak un,” a chi hi. Huchi in namsau kumpipa ma ah a honla uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Kumpipa’n, “Naungek hingpen tumnih suah unla, a kimkhat khat pia unla, a kimkhat a dang nu pia un, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Naungek hingpen nu in a ta a lainat mahmah ziak in kumpipa kiang ah, “Aw ka toupa, naungek hingpen amah pemai in, that mahmah ken” a chi hi. Khatpen in, “Kei a hituan kei henla, nang a leng lah hituan kei heh. Himahleh tumtan hi hen” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Huchi in, kumpipa’n a dawng a, “Naungek hingpen amah pia un, that kei un. Amah a nu ahi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Israel tengteng in huai thu a kumpipa thukhen dan a naza ua; kumpipa a lau uh. Vaihawm din Pathian pilna amah ah a om chih a thei uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huchi in Kumpipa Solomon Israel tengteng kumpipa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hiai a milian neihte ahi uh: “Zadok tapa Azariah siampu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Shisha tapa Elihoreph leh Ahiah Laigelhmi ahi uh. Ahilud tapa Jehosaphat tanchin gelhmi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jehoiada tapa Benaiah sepaih heutu ahi a; Zadok leh Abiathar siampu ahi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nathan tapa Azariah heutute tung a mi ahi a; Nathan tapa Zabud siampu leh kumpipa lawm ahi khawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahishar inn sung lam heutu ahi a; Abda tapa Adoniram phutluih a nasemte heutu ahi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Solomon in Israel tengteng tung ah heutu sawmlehnih a nei hi. Huaite’n kumpipa ading leh a inkawte adin nek leh tak a ngaihtuah zel uh. Mi khat in kum khat in kha khatzel nekding tak ding a pezel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hiaite a min uh ahi: “Ephraim tang gam ah Benhur.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Makaz, Shaalbim, Beth-shemesh leh Elon bethhanan ah Ben deker ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Arutboth ah Benhesed ahi a, aman Sokoh leh Hepher gam teng leng a tangkhawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Dor gam tengteng ah Ben Abinadab ahi a, aman Solomon zi tanu Taphath zi in a nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tanak khua leh Meggiddo khote, Jezreel khaw nuai, Zarethan khochin a om Beth shean bial teng ah, Beth shean apan Abel meholah, Jokmeam gam bul tan in Ahilud tapa Baana ahi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Ramoth Gilead ah Ben Geber ahi a, aman Manasseh tapa Jair khote, Gilead gam a omte a tang khawm hi. Bashan gam a Argob bial, khua thupi taktak sawmguk, kulh leh a kalhna daltawn neite leng a tangkhawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mahanaim ah Iddo tapa Ahinadab ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Naphtali ah Ahimaaz ahi a, aman leng Solomon tanu Basemath zi in a nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Asher leh Bealoth khua ah Husai tapa Baanah ahi a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Issakar ah Paruah tapa Jehosaphat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Benjamin ah Elah tapa Shimei
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amorte kumpipa Sihon leh Bashan kumpipa Og gam, Gilead gam ah Uri tapa Geber ahi a, Amah huai gam heutu omsun ahi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Judahte leh Israelte tuipi piau a piaunel zah mahmah in a tam ua, a ne un a dawn ua, nuamtak in a om zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Solomon in lui apan Philistiate gam leh Aigupta gamgi pha in gam teng ah vai a hawm hi. Thilpiakte a hon tawizel ua, Solomon damsung teng a na a sem uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Solomon ni khat annek, tangbuang nel mahmah pawt a sawmthum leh tangbuang pawt a sawmguk;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Bawngtal thau tak sawm, gam a bawngtal sawmnih leh belam za khat ahi uh. Hiaite lou leng sakhite, sangaite, sakhital, ak vakthaute leng ahilai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Luigal khenlam gam teng, Tiphsah apan Gaza tan, luigal khenlama kumpipate tung ah a lal hi. A kimvel a miteng toh kilem in a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Solomon damsung in Judahte leh Israelte Dan apan Beer–sheba tan in michih amau grep leh theipi chinna nuai ah bittak in a teng chiat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Solomon in kangtalai kai sakol sing li leh sakol tungtuang mi sing khat leh sang nih a nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hiai heutute’n amau tankha kha in Solomon leh kumpipa Solomon dohkan hongum teng nekding a pia ua, piak kimlouh a nei ngeikei uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Michih in a hih dia seh bang dungzui in a omna ding mun ah sakolte leh gan taihat mahmahte adin barli buh leh buhpawlte a honpua uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Pathian in Solomon pilna leh theihsiamna thupi mahmah leh lungsim letna tuipi piau a piaunel bang mai a pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Solomon pilna in suahlam ta tengteng pilna leh Aigupta mite pilna tengteng a khupvek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Mi tengteng sang in a pilzaw a, Mahol tate, Ezrah mi Ethan, Heman, Kalkol leh Darda sang in leng. Huchi in a kim a nam tengteng lak ah a min a thangkheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Paunak sang thum a gen a, a late sang khat leh nga ahi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Sing tanchin, Lebanon tang a Sidar sing apan kulhbang a hong selkhia hussop tan in a gen hi. Gamsate tanchin, vasate tanchin, bokvak a paite tanchin leh ngasate tanchin leng a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Huchi in Solomon pilna ngaikhe din a pilna zasa lei a kumpipa teng a hongpai uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan Tura kumpipa Hiram in Solomon kiang ah a sikhate a sawl hi. A pa mun ah kumpipa in amah thau a nilh uh chihlah a na zata ngal a. Hiram in David a it gige him ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Solomon in mi sawl in Hiram kiang ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Ka pa David in Toupa’n a khepek nuai a a koih masiah a kimvel a munchih mualchih a kidounate ziak a Toupa a Pathian min adia inn a lam theihlouh dan na thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuin Toupa ka Pathian in munchih mualchih ah muanna a hon neisakta hi. Melma leh vangsiatna leng a omkei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ngai dih, Toupa’n ka pa David kiang ah, ‘Na tapa na sik a na mangtutphah ka luahsak ding in ka min adin inn a honlam ding, chi a a na gensa bang in, Toupa ka Pathian min adin inn lam ka tum hi.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />huaiziak in, tuin Lebanon tang a sidar singte hon phuksak din thupia inla, ka sikhate leng na sikhate lak ah a hong telsam ding ua, na sikhate loh ahihleh na chih peuhmah k’on pe ding. Zidon mite bang a sing phuksiam ka lak uah kuamah a omkei uh, chih na theingal a” chi in a gensak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, Hiram in Solomon thu a zak in a kipak mahmah hi. “Hiai mi tampi tung a vaihawm dia tapa piltak David pepa Toupa tuni in phat in om hen” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huchi in Hiram in Solomon kiang ah, “N’on thukhah ka naza hi. Sidar sing thu leh meilah sing thu na deih peuhmah ka hih ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka sikhate’n Lebanon tang apan tuipi pha in a hon lasuk ding uh. N’on mun sehsak a tuipi a tolh din ka gaklomsak ding hi. Huai ah ka phelsak dia, nang nana la ding hi. Nang leng ka inkawte nekding tum in ka deih n’on hihsak sam ding” chi in mi a sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huchi in, Hiram in sidar sing leh meilah sing Solomon deih teng a pia hi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Solomon in Hiram inkawte nek din buh pawt a sing nih leh sathau suk pawt a sawmnih a pia hi. Hiai Solomon in kumtenga Hiram a piak dan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Toupa’n a chiam bangtak in Solomon pilna a pia hi. Hiram leh Solomon kikal ah kilemna a om a; a nih un kilemna thukhun a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kumpipa Solomon in Israel tengteng lak a phutluih nasemmi a bawl a; amau mi sing thum ahi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lebanon ah kha khat a kikheng zel in sing khat a sawl zel hi. Kha khat Lebanon ah a om ua, kha nih amau in ah. Adoniram phutluih nasem mite heutu ahi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Solomon in thilpawmi sing sagih leh suang sekmi sing giat tangte ah a nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huaite simlouh in Solomon in a nasep tung a heutu tuam, nasep vengmi sang thum leh za thum a neilai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kumpipa thupiakin inn suangphum dia lepdin suang lian pipi, suangmantam pipi leh suang seksa a honpua uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Inlammite, Solomon mite leh Hiram mite leh Gebal mite’n suangte a sek ua, huai inlamna din sing leh suangte a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, hichi ahi a, Israel suante Aigupta gam apan a pawt nung uh kum za li leh sawmgiatna kum, Israelte tung a Solomon a lal kum lina, Ziv kha, kha nihna in Toupa inn lam apan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Solomon in Toupa adia a inlam a dunglam tong sawmguk ahi a, a vailam tong sawmnih ahi, a sanlam tong sawmthum ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huai inn a Mun Siangthou malam a inlim a vailam tan tong sawmnih a sau ahi a, a malam a pen a vailam tong sawm ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />inn adin tohlet neuchik vathang kalh om in a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huai inn bang kimvel leh biakin bang kimvel in biakin mun bang kimvel leng huai inn bangsi in inn chial nei a lam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A kimvel in dantan a bawl a; a chial nuainung pen a vailam tong nga ahi a, a lai a pen a vailam tong guk ahi. A thumna a vailam tong sagih ahi. Kalvaite ahihleh inn bang a kigolh a kiphamoh kei. Inn pawlam ah a kimvel in bang ah a kingakna a kibawl ziak ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huai inn a lamlai un suang a laihna mun a seksa vek a bawl ahi. Huchi in a lamsung un sek ging, heipi ging leh sik vangzat ging huai inn ah zak ahi kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Dantan laita pente kongpi huai in taklam pang ah a om a; a laita ah kahna kivial in a kahtou ua, a laita apan a thumna ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huchi in huai inn a honlam a a zou a, inn bel sidar inkam leh a pek in a khuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Inchial neite a kisituah vek in tong nga chiat a sang in a lam a; huaite in toh sidar sing a peh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Solomon kiang ah Toupa thu a hongtung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hiai inn na lam laitak tung tangthu, ka thusehte na pom a, ka vaihawmte na zuih a, ka thupiak tengteng zui dia na pom peuhmah leh, na pa David kiang a ka gensa, huai ka thu na tung ah ka hihkip ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Israel suante lak ah ka teng dia, ka mi Israelte ka limsaklou kei ding, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huchi in, Solomon in huai inn a lam a, a zouta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Inn sung lam bang din sidar singpek a zang a; a pialkhang apan a tunglam bang pha in asung lam ah sing a belhvek hi. A pialkhang din meilah singpek a phah beh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />inn phaitam lam tong sawmnih pen pialkhang apan bangte tan in sidar singpek vek in a bawl a; biakna mun, Mun Siangthou pen adin leng a sunglam ah a zang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huai inn, a malam a biakin a dung lam tong sawmli ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huai inn sunglam ah a pakmum leh a pakpalh limgelh kilawm sidar sing a khuak a om a; avek in sidar singvek ahi a; suang himhim muh ahi kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Toupa thukhun bawm koihna din huai inn sung ah biakna lam ah mun a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huai, biakna mun sung a dunglam tong sawmnih, a vailam tong sawmnih, a sanlam tong sawmnih ahi a, dangkaeng hul ngen in a luan a; sidar sing a bawl maitam leng a luan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huchi in, Solomon in huai inn sung dangkaeng hul ngen in a luan a; biakna mun malam dangkaeng khainiang in a daikaih a; huai dangkaeng in a luan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huai in avek a a zohpha in a pumpi in dangkaeng in a luan tawmtawm hi. Biakna mun maitam pumpi leng dangkaeng in a luan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Biakna mun ah tong sawm tuaktuak a sang, Cherub nih olive sing in a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Cherub kha khatpen tong nga ahi a, Cherub kha langkhat pen tong nga mah ahi. A kha mong khat apan a kha langkhat mong kikal tong sawm ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Cherub khat pen leng tong sawm ahi a; Cherubte a kikim geih a, a kibang geih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cherub khat sanlam tong sawm ahi a, Cherub khat pen leng huai toh kikim mah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Cherubte inn sunggil zaw ah a koih a; cherubte kha a kizak a, khat kha in bang lang khatlam a va khoih a, Cherub khat pen kha in leng bang langkhat a khoihsama; huai inn laitak ah a kha uleh a kha uh a ki hihkha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Huai cherubte dangkaeng in a luan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />inn bang tengteng a kimvel in cherubte, tumsing leh pak palh limte gelh kilawm inn sunglam leh pawlam ah a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A inn pialkhang sunglam leh pawlam dangkaeng in a luan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Biakna mun lutna din olive sing kongkhak a bawl a; kongpi lutung leh kongpi biangte a bang seh nga suah seh khat chiat ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Huchi in, olive sing inn kongkhak nih a bawl a; huai ah cherubte tum sing leh pak palh limte gelh kilawm in a bawl hi. Huai dangkaeng in a luan a; cherubte leh tum singte dangkaeng in a luan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Biakin lutna din a bang seh li suah seh khat chia in olive kongpi khuam a bawllai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Meilah sing kongkhak nih toh; kongkhak khat a pek nihte kheptheih ahi a, kongkhak khat pen a pek nih leng kheptheih ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Huaite ah cherubte tum sing leh pak palh limte a gelh a; huai gelh kilawm mamtakin dangkaeng in a luan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Biakin huangsung intual sung gilzaw pen suangsek chial thum leh sidar singpek thuah khat in a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />A kum lina, Ziv kha in Toupa inn suangphum lepkhit ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />A kum sawm leh khatna, Bul kha, kha giatna in huai inn zuih ding bangbang a, bangkim mansa vek ahi. Huchi in kum sagih sung a lam hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, Solomon in a inn kum sawmlehthum a lam a, huchi in a inn teng a lamzou vekta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lebanon gammang inn, khuamvual li, khuam tung a sidar singpek tung ah a lam a; a dunglam tong za khat ahi. A vailam tong sawmnga ahi a, a sanlam tong sawmthum ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huai khuam a kinga dantan sawmli leh nga tunglam ah sidar singphel a khuh ahi a; vual khat ah sawmlehnga zel ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Vual thum ah tohlette a om a, vak leh vakte bel vual thum in a kigalsai vek uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kongkhak leh khuam tengteng singpek a ning li nei a bawl ahi a, vak leh vakte vual thum in a kigalsai vek uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Inlim khuam nei a bawl a; a dunglam tong sawmnga ahi a, a vailam tong sawmthum ahi. Huaite ma ah inlim a bawl a; a khuamte leh a ma a lutna tung kah toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A vaihawmna ding mangtutphah inlim, vaihawmna inlim, a vaihawmna ding a bawl hi. Huai pialkhang langkhat apan langkhat pha a sidar sing a khuh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A ma tenna din, inn lim nung a, huangsung intual dang nei om pen huchi mah bang a bawl ahi. Huai inlim mah bang in Pharo tanu Solomon in zi a a neih in a lamsak lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hiai tengteng suang manpha pipi, a hun geihgeih a sek zel suang, atna a at a lam ahi. Sunglam leng, pawlam leng a suangphum apan a lek pha in. Huchi mah bang in pawlam ah huangsung intual lianpi tanpha in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Suangphum suang manpha pipi, suang lian pipi, suang tong sawm leh suang tong giatte a lep ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huai tung lam ah suang manpha pipi, suang a hun geihgeih zel a sek leh sidar sing ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A kimvel in huangsung intual lianpi suangsek chial thum leh sidar singpek thuah khat a um ahi. Toupa inn huangsung intual sunggil zaw leh inn inlim mah bang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kumpipa Solomon in Tura khua apan mi sawl in, Hiram a sam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huai mi Naphtali nam meithai tapa ahi, a pa Tura khua mi, dalsekmi ahi. Amah dalseklam himhim ah a pil in a theihsiam in a khutsiam petmah hi. Kumpipa Solomon kiang ah a hoh a, a na tengteng a sepsak vek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Dal khuam nih, tong sawmlehgiat a sang; a kimvel a teh a tong sawmlehnih a lian tuaktuak a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Khuam lu a koih ding dalsun bawk nih a bawl a; bawk khat sanlam tong nga ahi a, bawk khat pen sanlam tong nga mah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khuampite dawn ah lubawkte gial im iam leh kihek ngin ngian a om a; hiai lubawk kisuangsawn bel khainiang kiphan sagih, bawk khat pen adin leng sagih mah a kituam ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huchi in khuamte a bawl a; khuam lu a bawkte tuamna din gial im iam khat tung ah a kimvel vual nih a om a; huchi mah bang in khat tung ah leng a omlai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Inlima khuamdawna bawk ah lili lim a tuanga, huai tong li ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Khuam nih dawna bawkte gei ah gial im iam kiang ah theibuhfaite a om a; theibuhfaite bel huai bawkte ah za nih tuaktuak a volh in a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Biakin inlim ah khuamte a dingsak a; taklam khuam a dingsak a, a min Jakin a sa a; veilam khuam leng a dingsak a; a min Boaz a sa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Khuamte dawn ah lili lim a tuang a; huchi in khuam lam nasep teng zoh siang ahita.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Dal tuibem lianpi, tong sawm, a sanlam tong nga asung a; a gei tong sawmthum kimkot ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A gei nuai ah pakmum lim in a kimvel vek a, tong sawm ahi a, tuibem kimvel in a om hi. Huai pakmumte vual nih in a om ua, sun khawm pah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Huai bawngtal sawmlehnih tung ah a kinga a, thum in mallam a nga ua, thum in tumlam a nga ua, thum in simlam a nga ua, thum in suahlam a nga uhi. Tuibem a tung uah a kitung a, a mei lam un a sunglam a doh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Khutpek chia a sah ahi a; a gei lili pak bang, nou gei bang a bawl ahi. Bath sang nih takna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tun sawnna sawm dal in a bawl a; tunsawnna khat saulam tong li ahi a, a vailam tong li mah ahi a, a sanlam tong thum ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tunsawnna bawl dan hichibang ahi. Huai in kuak a nei a, huai kuakte a geite kikal ah a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A geite kikal a kuakte ah humpinelkaite, bawngtalte leh cherubte a tuang a; a gei tungte ah tunsawnna a om hi. Humpinelkaite leh bawngtalte nuailam ah kilawmsaknate a om dindian hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tunsawnnate ah dal kangtalai li leh dal tung chih a om chiat a; a ning lite ah kingakna a om chiat hi. Kisilna nuai lam ah a kingakna sun a om a, a sik chiat ah kilawmsakna a omchiat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Valh gongsung tong khat ahi; a kam kimvel valh bang a bem ahi a, tong khat leh a kim ahi. A kam gei kimvel gial kilawm ahi a, a kuakte ning li ahi a, a bem kei uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Kangtalai lite a kuak nuai lam ah a om ua; kangtalai tungchihte tunsawnna ah a om uh. Kangtalai sandan tong khat leh a kim ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Huai kangtalaite bawldan sakol kangtalai khe bawldan bang ahi a; a tungchihte, a valhte, a sutkalhnate leh laibawkte avek a sun ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tunsawnna ning li chiat ah kingakna li a om a; huai kingaknate tunsawnna toh pumkhat vek ahi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tunsawnna tung ah valh, tong kimkhat a sang a om a; tunsawnna tung a a tunna khete leh a kuakte pumkhat vek ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />A tunna khepekte leh a kuakte ah a zat bangbang in cherubte, humpinelkaite leh tumsingte a tuangsak a, a kimvel in kilawmsakna a om dindian hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Huchibang vek in tunsawnna sawm a bawl a; avek in pumkhat a sun ahi chiat ua, kikim chiat, bawldan kibang geih ahi chiat uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Kisilna bel sawm dal in a bawl a; kisilna bel khat in bath sawmli a dong a; kisilna bel tong li chiat ahi uh. Tunsawnna sawm tung ah kisilna bel khat a kitung chiat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tunsawnnate inn taklam pang ah nga a tung a, inn veilam pang ah nga mah. Tuibem pen inn taklam pang ah suahlam ah simlam nga in a tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Hiram in kisilna belte, vutluahte, maiphiatkuangte a bawl a, huchi in, Toupa inn adia Solomon a bawlsak teng a zousiangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Khuam nihte, khuam dawn a bel bang a bawk nihte, khuam dawn a bel ban a bawk nih tuamna gial im iam nihte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />tuamna gial im iam nih adia theibuhfai za lite, khuam dawn a bel bang a bawk nih tuamna ding gial im iam tuaktuak adia theibuhfai vual nihte;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />tunsawnna sawm leh tunsawnna tung a kisilna bel sawmte;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />tuibem khat leh tuibem nuai a bawngtal sawmlehnihte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />belte, vutluahte leh maiphiatkuangte toh. Tuium-belsuan tengteng Toupa inn adia Hiram in kumpipa Solomon a bawlsak dal nawttet a bawl vek ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Jordan phaizang ah Sukkoth leh Zarethan kikal a bellei omna ah hiai teng kumpipa’n asung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Huai tuium-belsuan tengteng a tam mahmah ziak in Solomon in buk khelou in a koih a; dal bukzah pen theihkhiak ahi kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Solomon in Toupa inn a tuium-belsuan om tengteng a bawl a; dangkaeng maitam leh tanghou koihna dohkan dangkaeng in a luan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Mun siangthou pen ma a khawnvak koihnate, taklam a nga leh veilam a ngate dangkaeng siang in; pakte, khawnvakte leh taitehte dangkaeng in a luan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Noute, khawnvak puantehnate, maiphiatkuangte, keute leh meilaknate dangkaeng siang in; inn sunggil zaw, Mun Siangthou pen kongkhakte leh inn, biakin, kongkhak bulhnate dangkaeng in a luan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Huchi in, kumpipa Solomon in Toupa inn adia a bawl tengteng a zouvekta hi. Huchi in Solomon in a pa David inn a na latkhitsa dangkachite, dangkaeng leh tuiumbelsuante a lalut a, Toupa inn a goute lak ah a koihta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huchi in Solomon in Israel upate, a nam intekpen tengteng Israel suan inkuan intekpente, Jerusalem khua a kumpipa Solomon kiang ah David khopi Zion apan Toupa thukhun bawm zawngtou din a kaikhawm vek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel mi tengteng Ethanim kha, kha sagihna ah, Ankuangluina ah kumpipa Solomon kiang ah a kikaikhawm vek uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel upa tengteng a hong ua, siampute’n bawm a zawng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Toupa bawm leh Kihoupihna Puanin leh puanin a tuium-belsuan siangthou tengteng tan in siampute leh Levi chite’n a zawngtou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kumpipa Solomon leh Israel kikaikhawm tengteng a kiang a hong kikhawmte bawm ma ah a omkhawm uh. Belam leh bawngtal a tam ziak a simseng vuallouh leh a zah theih seng vuallouh in a kithoih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Siampute’n Toupa thukhun bawm a omna ding, inn sung a biakna mun a Mun Siangthou pen ah cherubte kha nuai ah a lalut uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cherubte’n bawm omna tungzawn ah a kha uh a zak gige ngal ua, cherubte’n bawm leh a zawnna chiangtawnte a huapvek uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A zawnna chiangtawn a sau mahmah a, a zawnna chiangtawn mongte biakna mun ma, Mun Siangthou apan a muhtheih hi. Himahleh in pawlam ah zaw a dawk kei, tuni tan huai ah a om nilouh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aigupta gam apan a pawt ua Toupa Israel suante toh thu a khunlai a Mosi in Horeb tang a suangpek nih a koihte kia louzaw, huai bawm sung ah bangmah dang a omkei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, siampute Mun Siangthou apan a hongpawt khiak tak un Toupa inn meipi in a hong dim meuhmouh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Meipi ziak in siampute nasem in a om theikei uh. Toupa thupina in Toupa inn lah a dimsak vek ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Solomon in thu a gen a: “ Toupa’n , mial bikbek ah ka om ding, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na tenna din, tangtawn a na om gige na ding inn k’on lamsak petmah hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kumpipa a kinunghei a, Israel kikaikhawm tengteng a vualzawl a, Israel kikaikhawm tengteng ading dipdep uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aman, “ Toupa , Israelte Pathian, ka pa David kiang a amah kam mahmah a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aigupta gam apan ka mi Israelte ka pikhiak ni apan Israel nam lak a koilai khua leng ka min omna ding, inlamna ding ka tel ngeikei hi. Himahleh ka mi Israelte heutu din David ka tel hi, chi a a na genpa, amah khut mahmah a hon pichingsakpa phat in om hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka pa David in Israelte Pathian, Toupa min dia inlam a lungsim in a na tum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Himahleh Toupa’n ka pa David kiang ah, Na lungsim in ka min adin inn lam na tuma, hichibang lungsim na put na hihhoih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Himahleh nang zaw, inn na lam kei ding. Na tapa, na khal a hong pawtkhe ding in ka min adin inn a lamzaw ding, a na chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Toupa’n a thugen a hon hihkip a; Toupa’n a na chiamsa bang ngei in ka pa David mun k’on luah in, Israel mangtutphah ah kongtuta a, Israelte Pathian, Toupa min adin inn ka na lamta ngei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huai ah bawm omna ding mun ka na sep a, huai ah Aigupta gam apan a pikhiaklai a i pute uh kiang a a thukhun, Toupa thukhun a om” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Solomon Toupa maitam ma, Israel hong kikhawm tengteng muh in ading a, vanlam ah a khut a zaktou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Aw Toupa , Israelte Pathian, na sikha lungtang tengteng na mit muh a omte kiang a thukhun tangtun a hehpihna hihlang zel, na sikha ka pa David kiang a thuchiam tangtunpa, tunglam ah leh nuailam lei ah nang bang Pathian dang a omkei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ahi, nang na kam in thu na gen a, na khut in n’on lohching sakta a, tuni a, a hong omta ngei bang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />huaiziak in, aw Toupa Israelte Pathian, na sikha ka pa David kiang a, na suante ka mitmuh a na om bang a ka mit muh a omsam dia a omdan ua a pilvan peuhmah uleh ka mitmuh in Israelte mangtutphah a tu ding na tatlak kei ding, chi a na chiam tangtun in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Aw Israelte Pathian, na sikha ka pa David kiang a thu na gensa hehpih in tungsak in.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Himahleh Pathian lei ah a teng petmah dia hia? Ngai in, van leh vante van a leng talou na hi a; hiai ka inn lam ah naktat tuakkei na tel chia!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Himahleh Toupa ka Pathian, tuni a na sikha in a honsapna thumna, a thusam ngaihkhiaksak in, na sikha thumna leh ngetna hon limsak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hiai mun lamnga a na sikha in thum a a thusam ding ngaikhia a, nang, huai ah ka min a om ding, na chihna mun ngei a, inn lam a sun leh zan in na mit a hah gige theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Na sikha leh na mi Israelte’n hiai munlam nga a, a hong thum chiang un a ngetnate uh na ngaihkhiak sakzel in. Ahi, na tenna mun, van ah na ngaikhia in; ngaikhia inla, ngaidam in.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Mi kuapeuh in a invengte tung ah thil hihkhial in, kichiam sak hial a hong kiphatmoh leh hiai inn a na maitam ma ah hong kichiam henla,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Nang van ah na ngaikhia inla, gamtang inla na sikhate vaihawm sak in, migilou pen mawhpaih in a lu tung ah a omdan nga inla, midiktat pen siamtang sak in a diktatna bangbang amah pia in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Na mi Israelte’n na tung a thil a hihkhelh ziak ua melmate lak a a vuallelh ua nang lam a hong ngatnawn ua, na min a phat ua, hiai inn a thum a thil a honnget uleh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Nang van ah a na ngaihkhiak sak inla, na mi Israelte khelhna ngaidam inla, a pute uh gam na piak ah pikik nawn in.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />“Na tung a thil a hihkhelh ziak ua van a kikhak a, vuah a hong zuklouh hun chiang in, hiai munlam nga a hongthum ua, na min a puankhiat ua, amau na bawl gentheih ziak a a khelhnate uh a kisik uleh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Nang van ah a na ngaikhia inla, na sikhate leh na mi Israelte khelhna ngaidam inla, a paina ding uh lampi hoih sinsak inla, na mite goutan dia na piak na gam ah vuah zusak in.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />“Ka gam ua kial a hong kiaka, hipi a honglen a, keuna hiam, muatna hiam, khaukhup hiam, lung hiam a hongom a, a melmate un a kongpi kim ua a hongum ua, hipi khat peuh, chinatna bangpeuh a hongtun leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Na mi Israel tengteng lak a amau lungtang a hipi om a thei a, hiai inn lam nga a khut zankhia a, thumna leh ngetna a honlat uleh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Na omna van ah a na ngaikhia inla, ngaidam inla, gamtang inla, nang a lungtang uh theipa, michih a omdan bangbang in lohching sak in; Nang zaw, nangmah kia mihingta tengteng lungtang theipa lah na hi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Ka pute uh na piak gam a a ten laiteng uh nang a honlauh theihna ding un.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />“Na mi Israelte hilou namdang, na min ziak a gam gamlapi apan hongpaite tungtang thu leng;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Na min thupi mahmah, na khut hat mahmah, na ban na zak thu a na zachiat ding ahi ngal ua, huaite’n hiai inn lam nga a, a hongthum chiang un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Nang na omna van ah a na ngaikhia inla, namdang in a hon nget a na hihsak in. Na mi Israelte bangmah a namchih in na min a theih ua, laudan a hong siam ua, hiai ka inn lam in na minpu ahi chih a hon theihtheihna ding un.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />“Na mite’n a melmate uh na sawlna lamlam ah a dou ua, na khopi tel lam nga leh, na min adia ka lam inn lam nga a, Toupa kiang a a hong thum uleh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />A thumna uleh ngetna uh nang van ah a na ngaikhia inla, a thu uah gamtang in.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />“Na tung a thil a hihkhelh uleh, kuamah thil hihkhial lou lah a om ngal kei a; a tung ua na hehna, melma gam gamla mahmah hiam, naichik hiam a leng sal a a pi ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Sal a a pina gam ua a hong kingaihtuah khiak ua, a kisik ua, thil i na hihkhial hi, diklou tak leh gil mahmah in i na gamtata uh, chi a sal a pimite gam a nang a honnget uleh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />A melma amau sal a pite gam a a lungtang tak uleh a lungsim tak ua nang lam a hong ngat ua, a pute uh na piak gam lam leh na khopi tel lam leh na min adia ka inn lam lamnga a na kiang a a hongthum uleh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />A thumna uleh a ngetna uh nang na omna van ah a na ngaikhia inla, a thu uah gamtang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Na mi na tung a thil hihkhialte leh na tung a a na tatlekna uah a tatleknate tengteng uh ngaidam inla; sal a pite’n a hehpih theihna ding un hehpihna neisak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Na mi na goutan, Aigupta gam apan sik haltuina sung apan na pikhiakte lah ahi uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />“A honsap chiang ua na ngaihkhiak dia, na sikha ngetna leh na mi Israelte ngetna lam a na mit na hah gige theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Aw Toupa Pathian, ka pute uh Aigupta gam apan na pikhiak lai a na sikha Mosi zang a na gen bang in na goutan din khovel namchih lak apan na hihtuam lah ahi ngal ua, a chi hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, Solomon in Toupa kiang a a thumna leh ngetna tengteng a genkhit in, Toupa maitam ma a khukdin a, vanlam ah a khut zaktou a omlai a thou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />A ding tou a, aw ngaihtak in Israel kikhawm tengteng a vualzawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />“A thuchiam tengteng bangzel a, a mi Israelte khawlna pepa Toupa phat in om hen. A sikha Mosi zang a a thuchiam hoih tengteng thu khat leng a vuaksuak kei, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Toupa i Pathian, i pute kiang a, a om bang in i kiang uah om henla; hon paisan in hon donsak lou kei hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Huchi in a lampi tengteng tawn ding leh i pipute a na piak khitsa bang a, a thupiakte, a thusehte, a vaihawmte zui dia i lungtangte Amah lam a a ngatsak theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />A sikha thu leh a mi Israelte thu ah a ni omdan bangzel a, a gamtat theihna din hiai ka thugen, Toupa ma a ngetna ka tutte sun leh zan in Toupa i Pathian ma ah om gige hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Toupa Pathian ahi a, kuamah dang a omkei uh chih khovel a namchih in a theihtheihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Huchi in a thuseh bang a om ding leh a thupiakte zui din Toupa i Pathian lam ah na lungtangte uh hoihkim hen, tuni a bang in.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Israel tengteng leh Solomon in Toupa ma ah kithoihna a lan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Solomon in Toupa adia a lat kilemna kithoihna din bawngtal sing nih leh sang nih leh belam nuai khat leh sing nih ahi. Huchibang in kumpipa leh Israel suan tengteng in Toupa inn a lan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />Huai ni mah in kumpipa’n Toupa inn ka zawn a intual huangsung laitak a hih siangthou hi. Huai ah haltum thillatte, tangbuang thillatte, kilemna thillat thaute a lan hi. A ziak bel huai haltum thilatte, tangbuang thilatte, kilemna thillat sathaute huai dal maitam a tat zohlouh ziak ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />Huchi in, huai hun in Solomon leh Israel tengteng, mipi kikhawm tampi, Hamath lutna apan Aigupta gamlui pha a mite’n Toupa i Pathian ma ah ni sagih leh ni sagih, ni sawmlehli sung Ankuang a lui khawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />A ni giat ni’n mipite a kikhen sak a, amau kumpipa a vualzawl ua, huchi in Toupa’n a sikha David leh a mi Israelte tung a a hoihna huchi lawmlawma a latsak ziak in lungsim nuamsa leh kipak mahmah in a inlam uah a paita uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, hichi ahi a, Solomon in Toupa inn leh kumpipa inn lam a, lunggulhtaka, a tup tengteng a hih khitvek nung in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Gibeon khua a, a kiang a, a kilak bang in Toupa Solomon kiang ah a hong kilak nawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Toupa’n a kiang ah, “Na thumna leh na ngetna ka ma a n’on tutte ka na ngaikhia hi. Na inn lam tangtawn a ka min omna din ka hih siangthouta hi. Ka mit leh ka lungtang huai ah tangtawn in a omta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nang leng thu k’on piak peuhmah bang a hih dia na pa David a om bang lungtang hoihtakpu leh lungsim diktakpu a ka mitmuh a na om a, ka thusehte leh ka vaihawmte na zuih gige leh
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Israelte tung ah na gam mangtutphah tangtawn adin ka hihkip ding a; na pa David kiang a, Israelte mangtutphah a tu ding na tatlak kei ding, chi a ka na chiamsa bang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Himahleh nang hiam na suante hiam in n’on zuih uh kiksan a, ka thupiakte leh ka thusehte leh k’on theihsakte pomlou a, pathian dangte nna nasep ua, na biak uleh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Gam ka piak apan Israelte ka hihmang dia; hiai inn ka min adia ka hihsiangthou sa ka mitmuh phaklouh ah ka suanmang ding. Huchi in Israel nam chihte lak ah enghouna leh a selam gentehna a zat a honghi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hiai inn sangtawk lehleng, a kiang a pai peuhmah in lamdang sa in a muk uh a hum ding ua, bangdia Toupa’n hiai gam leh hiai inn hichitel a hih adiam aw? a chi ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mite’n Toupa a Pathian uh, a pute uh Aigupta gam apan pikhepa a paisan ua, pathian dangte a let ua, a biak ua, a nate uh a sepziak uh ahi. Huaiziak in, Toupa’n hiai siatna tengteng a tung uah a tungsakta hi” chi in a dawng ding uh, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, Solomon inn nihte; Toupa inn leh kumpipa inn a lamsung kum sawmnih a beinung in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tura kumpipa Hiram in Solomon sidar singte, meilah singte leh dangkaengte a kulteng a tup sakvek ahi, kumpipa Solomon in Galili gam a khua sawmnih Hiram a pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Solomon in a piak khuate en din Tura khua apan Hiram a pawtkhia a; a va en a himahleh a lungtung kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aman, Unaupa aw, hiai n’on khopiakte bangchibang khua a maizen ua? a chi hi. Huchi in tunitan in aman huai khuate Kabul gam a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hiram in dangkaeng talent za leh sawmnih kumpipa a khak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kumpipa Solomon in phutluih nasem pawl a bawl nasan hiai ahi: Toupa inn leh amah inn lam ding leh Millo, Jerusalem kulh, hazor khua, Meggiddo khua leh Gezer khuate bawl ding in ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aigupta kumpipa Pharo a hohtou a, Gezer khua a vala a, a hal a, huai khua a teng Kanaante a that a, a tanu Solomon zi thilpiak in a na pekhinta ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Solomon in Gezer, Bethhoron khangnung zaw,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Baalath leh Israel gamdai a Tadmor khuate,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Solomon in thil koihkhawmna khua a neih tengteng, a kangtalai koihna khuate, Jerusalem khua leh Lebanon a vaihawmna gamsung tengteng Solomon in lunggulhtaka bawl a tup tengteng a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Israel suante hilou, Amorte, Hitte, Perizte leh Jebus omsun tengtengte;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />a suan uh, huai gam a omlai Israel suante’n a hihman zohvek theihlouhte lak ah Solomon in sikha, phutluih nasem pawl a bawl a, tunitan in a sem lai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Israel suante bel Solomon in sikha in a bawl kei. Galdou mite, a intekpate, a miliante, a sepaih heutute, a kangtalai leh a sakol tung tuang pawl heutute ahizaw uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hiaite Solomon nasep tung a heutu tuam, za nga leh sawmnga, nasep veng mite ahi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Himahleh Pharo tanu bel David khopi apan amah in, Solomon inn a lamsak ah a paitou hi. Huchi in Solomon in Millo a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Solomon in Toupa adia a bawl maitam ah kumteng in thumvei haltum thillat leh kilemna thillat a lan a, Toupa ma a maitam ah gimlimte a hal hi. Huchi in inn a lamzouta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Kumpipa Solomon in Edom gam a Tuipi San gei Eloth chin a om Ezion-geber mun ah longhon a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hiram in a sikha longmite, tuipi a kiseksa, long a Solomon sikhate kiang ah a sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Huai mite Ophir ah a vahoh ua, dangkaeng talent za li leh sawmnih a honpua ua, kumpipa Solomon kiang a hontun uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, Toupa min a a thilhih tungtang thu a Solomon minthan dan Sheba kumpinu’n a na zak in thu haksa pipi toh amah ettel tum in a kiang ah a honghoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jerusalem khua ah nungzuimi tampi toh, gimlimte leh dangkaeng tampi leh suangmantamte pua sangawngsaute tonpih in a hoh hi. Solomon kiang a tun in a lungtang a thu a pai tengteng suah khevek in a houpih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Solomon in a thudot tengteng a dawngvek a; kumpipa theihlouh, a hilhchet theihlouh himhim a omkei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sheba kumpinu’n Solomon pildan tengteng, a inn lam,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A dohkan a nekding, a sikhate tutdan, a nasemte nasep dan, a kivatdante uh, a nou pemite, Toupa inn a lat haltum thillatte a muh in lungsim chih leng nei zouloukhop in lamdang a sa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huchi in kumpipa kiang ah, na thilhihte leh na pildante ka gam a ka zak thuthang a dikmah a na hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Himahleh keimah mit mahmah a kongmuh masiah a gen uh ka taksang kei hi. Huchi in ngai in, a kimkhat leng a hon na hilh sam ua, a gen uh ka zak sang in na pildan leh na hoih dan a na thupizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na mite, hiai na sikha, na kiang a om gige na pilna thu ngaikhe gigete a hampha uhi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian, na tung a kipak mahmah, Israelte mangtutphah a hon tusakpa phat in om hen. Toupa’n Israelte tangtawn in a it a, huaiziak in, diktattak a vaihawm din kumpipa’n a honbawl hi, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huchi in dangkaeng talent za leh sawmnih leh gimlim a tam a tam leh suangmantamte kumpipa a pia a, Sheba kumpinu’n kumpipa Solomon gimlim a piak bang lawmlawm a tam a lut ngeita kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hiram longhon, Ophir apan dangkaeng vapawte’n leng Ophir apan almug sing tampi leh suangmantamte a honpua uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kumpipa’n almug singte Toupa inn leh kumpipa inn umna ding in leh lasamite kaihging leh pekging bawlna din a zang hi. Tunitan in hichibang almug sing himhim a lut in, muh leng muh ahi nawnta kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A nget louh Solomon in a piakte chihlouh leng kumpipa Solomon in Sheba kumpinu’n a deih tengteng, a nget peuhmah a pia hi. Huchi in amah leh lawite a omna gam ah a pai nawnta uhi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Solomon kiang a kum khat sung a dangkaeng lut gikdan dangkaeng talent za guk leh sawmguk leh guk ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hiaite lou leng sumsinmite leh thilzuakmite, Arab kumpipate leh gamsung vaihawmmite apan siahpiakte a neilai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kumpipa Solomon in dangkaeng sekpek in lum lian za nih a bawl a; lum khat ah dangkaeng sekel za guk a lut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Dangkaeng sekpek in lum za thum a bawl a; lum khat ah dangkaeng mina thum a lut a; huaite kumpipa’n Lebanon gammang inn ah a koih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kumpipa’n saiha mangtutphah thupi mahmah a bawl a, huai dangkaeng hoihpen tui in a luan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />mangtutphah kaltouhna ah siksan guk a om a, mangtutphah nunglam dawn a bem hi. A tutna siktuak ah douna a om tuaktuak a; a douna zulte ah humpinelkai ding lim nih a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Siksan gukte siktuak ah humpinelkai ding sawmlehnih lim a om a; huchibang koi gam ah leng a bawl ngeikei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kumpipa nou tengteng dangkaeng ahivek a, Lebanon gammang inn a, a tuium-belsuan tengteng leng dangkaeng ngen mah ahivek uhi. Dangka himhim a omkei. Solomon damlai in huai bangpi in a simkei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kumpipa’n tuipi ah Hiram longhon kithuahpih Tarsis longhon a nei a; Tarsis longhon in kum thum halzel in dangkaeng, dangka, saiha, zawng leh utong a hon paw zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Huchi in kumpipa Solomon in khovel a kumpipa tengteng hauh lam leh pillam in a khupvek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Pathian in a lungtang a pilna thu a koihsak ngaikhe din khovel a mi tengteng in Solomon a hongzuan huthut zel uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Michih in thilpiakte kum teng a piak zah nei in dangka tuium-belsuan, dangkaeng tuium-belsuan, puan, galvan, gimlim, sakol leh sabiltung noute a hong pe zel uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Solomon in kangtalaite leh sakol tungtuangmite a kaikhawm a, kangtalai sang khat leh za li leh sakol tungtuangmi sing khat leh sang nih a nei hi. Huaite kangtalai koihnate ah, Jerusalem khua a kumpipa omna ah a omsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Kumpipa’n Jerusalem khua ah a tam mahmah ziak in dangka chite suang bang mai a sehkhop in a omsak a, sidar singte phai a theipi sing banglel a sehkhop in a omsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Solomon neih sakolte Aigupta gam apan a hon tolhkhiak ahi a; kumpipa sumsinmite’n huaite a honhon in a na khakzel ua, a hon a leizel ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Aigupta gam a kangtalai dangka chi sekel za guk zel in leh sakol dangka chi sekel za leh sawmnga zel in a hon pawlut uhi. Huchibang mah in Hitte kumpipa tengteng leh Suria kumpipate adin leng a pawkhia uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Himahleh Solomon in Pharo tanu ban ah namdang numei tampi a it hi. Amau Moabte, Ammonte, Edomte, Zidonte leh Hitte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huai namte tungtang thu Toupa’n Israel suante kiang ah, “Amau toh na kitentuah hetlouh ding uh ahi. Na kitentuah uh leh a pathiante uh lam a na lungtang uh hon ngasak ngeingei ding uh ahi” chi a na hilhkhit tak namte ahi uh. Hinapi in Solomon in amau it in a len chinten hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huchi in zipi za sagih, kumpipa tanute a nei a, mei za thum a nei hi. Huai a zite’n amah a lam pialsakta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hichi a honghi a, Solomon a hong upat nung in, a zite’n pathian dangte lam ah a lungtang a pikawi sak uh. Huchi in a pa David lungtang bang in Toupa a Pathian lam ah a lungtang a hoihkim takei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Solomon in Zidonte pathiannu Ashtaroth leh Ammonte pathian kihhuai mahmah Milkom a zuita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huchi in Solomon in Toupa mitmuh in thil gilou a hihta a, a pa David bang in Toupa a zui tettet kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huchi in Solomon in Jerusalem chin a tang ah Moabte pathian kihhuai mahmah Khemosh ading leh, Ammon suante Pathian kihhuai mahmah Molech adin munsang a bawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huai mah bang in namdang a zi tengteng a pathiante uh kiang a kithoih a gimlim halzelte ading leng a bawlsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huchi in, Toupa Israelte Pathian, a kiang a nihvei kilak khinsa a lungtang in a lehngatsan ziak in, Solomon tung ah Toupa a hehta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hiai thu, pathian dangte na zui ding ahi kei, chih thu a na pepa Toupa thupiak lah a zuikei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huaiziak in, Toupa’n Solomon kiang ah, “Hichibang in na omta a, ka thukhun leh ka thusehte zuih dia thu k’on piak lah na zuita kei hi. Gam k’on sut ngeingei dia, na sikha ka pe ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Himahleh na pa David ziak in na damsung tel in zaw ka hih tadih kei ding. Himahleh na tapa khut apan gam pen konsut ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Gam tengteng k’on sutvek kei dia; himahleh ka sikha David ziak leh ka tel Jerusalem ziak in nam khat na tapa ka pe ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Toupa’n Edom mi, Hadad Solomon melma din ading khesakta a; amah Edom gam kumpipa suan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huan hichi ahi a, David Edom gam a, a omlai a, a mi thahte uh vui dia a sepaih heutu Joab a hohtou a, Edom mi pasal peuhmah a vathah khitnung in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Joab leh Israel mi tengteng kha guktak Edom gam a pasal tengteng a hihlup khit masiah om uh ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hadad leh a pa sikhate lak a Edom mi khenkhatte Aigupta gam ah a tai ua; Hadad ahihleh naupang neu ahilai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Midian gam apan a pawt ua, Paran a hongtung uh. Paran apan mite a pi ua, Aigupta gam, Aigupta gam kumpipa Pharo kiang a tungsuk ua; aman inn a na pia a, nek dingte a na ngaihtuahsak a, gam leng a na pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hadad Pharo mit a tung mahmah a, huchi in a ma zi sanggamnu, kumpinu Tahpenes sanggamnu a zi din a pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tahpenes sanggamnu in tapa Genubath a neihsak a, Tahpenes in Pharo inn ah a nawinek tawpna a bawlsak hi. Genubath Pharo inn ah Pharo tate lak ah a omta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hadad in Aigupta gam apan David a pute kiang ah a ihmuta chih leh sepaih heutu Joab leng a sita chih a na zak in, Hadad in Pharo kiang ah, “Ka gam ua ka paitheihna din hon pawtsak ve” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huchi in, Pharo in a kiang ah, “Ka kiang a na om in taksap bang na nei a? Ngai in, huchi a na gam ua pai nawn na tup maimah?” a chi hi. Aman, “Bangmah neilou e. Bang teng hileh hon paisak himhim in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Pathian in a melma din Eliadah tapa Rezon, a toupa Hadadezer, Zobah kumpipa apan taimangsa a dingsak nawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />David in Zobah khua a mite a thahlai in aman a kiang ah mite a kaikhawm a, sepaih heutu in a na pang hi. Damaska khua ah a hoh ua, huai ah a teng ua, Damaska khua ah kumpipa in a tuta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hadad in buaina tut behlap in Solomon damsung teng Israelte melma ahi gige a; Israelte a haw mahmah a, Suria gam tung ah vai a hawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Nebat tapa Jeroboam, Zered a Ephraim mi Solomon sikha mah, a nu min Zeruah ahi a, meithai ahi, huai mi’n leng kumpipa tung ah a khut a lik sam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Kumpipa tung a a khut a hon likna san hichibang ahi: Solomon in Millo a bawl a, a pa David khua siatna lailai a bawlhoih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Jeroboam ahihleh mihat leh hangsan ahi a; huchi in Solomon in huai tangval mi thanuamtak ahi chih a theih ziak in Joseph inkawte nasep tengteng tung ah heutu in a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Huailai in hichi ahi a, Jeroboam Jerusalem khua apan a pawt khiak lai in Shiloh mi zawlnei Ahijah in lampi ah a na mu a; Ahijah in puan thak a silh a; amau gel kia in gamlak ah a om uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ahijah in a puanthak silh a la a, nen sawmlehnih in a botkek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Jeroboam kiang ah, “Nen sawm la in.” Toupa , Israelte Pathian in hichi in a chi, “Ngai in, Solomon khut apan lalgam ka sut dia, nam sawm nang k’on pe ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Himahleh ka sikha David ziak leh Israel nam tengteng lak a ka tel khopi, Jerusalem ziak in nam khat a nei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Amau hon paisan a , Zidonte pathiannu Ashtaroth, Moabte pathian Kemosh leh Ammonte pathian Milkom a biak ziak un leh ka mitmuh a thil hoih hih ding leh ka sehte leh ka vaihawmte zui dia a pa David bang a ka lampite a zuihlouh ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Gam pumpi ka sutkei dia; himahleh ka thupiakte leh ka thusehte zuipa, ka tel, ka sikha David ziak in a damsung in kumpipa in ka om saklai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Himahleh lalgam a tapa khut apan ka sutkhe dia, nang k’on pe ding, nam sawmte tan in leng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ka sikha David in ka min omna dia ka tel khopi Jerusalem a ka ma a vak a neih gige theihna din nam khat bel a tapa ka pe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Nang k’on sep dia, na ut tengteng bang in vai na hawm dia, Israelte kumpipa na hi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Hichi ahi ding a, thu k’on piak peuhmah na pom a, ka lampite na zuih a, ka sikha David bang a ka thusehte leh ka thupiakte zui dia ka mitmuh a thil hoih na hihleh na kiang ah ka om dia, David adia ka dinkip sak bang in inkuan kip k’on din khiaksak dia, Israelte k’on pe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Huchi in David suan ka hihgim dia, himahleh tangtawn in zaw ahi kei ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Huaiziak in, Solomon in Jeroboam thah a tuma, Jeroboam ading a, Aigupta gam ah, Aigupta gam kumpipa Shishak kiang ah a tai a, Solomon sih matan Aigupta gam ah a omta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Solomon tanchin dangte leh a thilhih tengteng leh a pilna Solomon thilhih gelhna bu ah a tuang ka hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Solomon in Israel tengteng tung a Jerusalem a vai a hawm sung kum sawmli ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Huchi in Solomon a pute kiang ah a ihmuta a, a pa David khopi ah a vui uhi. Huchi in a tapa Rehoboam a sik in a hong lalta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, Rehoboam Sekem khua ah a hoh hi. Israel tengteng Sekem khua ah kumpipa a amah bawl din a hoh khinta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, Nebat tapa Jeroboam in huai thu a na zak in Kumpipa Solomon kiang apan a taimangna Aigupta gam a omlai ahi a, huchi in Jeroboam Aigupta gam a om ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amah a va samsak ua, Jeroboam leh Israel kikaikhawm tengteng a hong ua, Rehoboam kiang ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Na pa’n ka hakkol uh a giksak mahmah hi. Huaiziak in, na pa honzat gimna leh a hakkol giktak ka tung ua a ngak hon hihzang sak inla, huchi in nang na ka sem ding uh” chi in a hong gen uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aman a kiang uah, “Ni thum sung va kikhin khephot unla; ka kiang ah hongpai nawn un” a chi hi. Huchi in mite a paikheta uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kumpipa Rehoboam in a pa Solomon damlai a, a kiang a om upate, “Hiai mite bangchi’n ka dawng dia honhilh mah dih uh” chi’n a dong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amau a kiang ah, “Tuni a hiai mite sikha a na om a, a na uh sem a, amau dawng a, a kiang ua thu hoih na gen leh, tangtawn in na sikha in a om ding uh” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Himahleh upate hoihsak a zuikei a, amah toh kivual tuailai a kiang a omte a dong zawta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A kiang uah, “Hiai mite, ka kiang a, Na pa’n ka tung ua hakkol a ngak hon hihzang sak in, chi a hong genmite bangchi’n ka dawng dia, honhilh mah dih uh” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A khanvual tuailaite’n a kiang ah, “Hiai mite, Na pa’n ka hakkol uh a giksak thei mahmah a, nang hon hihzang sak dihve, na kiang a chi mite kiang ah, hichibang in chi inla, hichibang in a kiang uah gen in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />‘Ka pa kawng sang in ka khutme a lianzaw. Ka pa’n hakkol giktak a hon na batsak a, ken na hakkol uh ka behlap lai ding hi. Ka pa’n zepna in a honsawi a, ken aikam in k’on sawi ding’ a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huchi in Jeroboam leh mi tengteng kumpipa’n ni thum nung chiang in “Ka kiang ah hong nawn un” chi a a hilh bang in, a ni thum ni’n Rehoboam kiang ah a vahoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kumpipa’n mite khauhtak in a na dawng a, upate hoihsak a paisan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuailaite hoihsak bang in, “Ka pa’n na hakkol uh a na giksak a, ken na hakkol uh ka behlap lai dia, ka pa’n zepna in a hon na sawi a, ken ahihleh aikam in k’on sawi ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huchi in kumpipa’n mite thu a ngaikheta kei a; hiai bang a thil om Toupa apan lah ahi ngal a. Toupa’n Shiloh mi Ahijah zang a Nebat tapa Jeroboam kiang a, a thugen sepkhiat a hih theihna ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Israel tengteng in kumpipa’n a thugen uh a pom kei chih a theih un, “David ah tantuan bang i nei ua? Jesse tapa ah gouluah ding i neikei uh. Israelte aw, na puanin chiat uah pai un. David, na inkuan kingaihtuah in” chi in kumpipa a dawng uh. Huchi in Israelte a puanin chiat uah a paita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Himahleh Judah khopite a teng Israel suante tung ah Rehoboam in vai a hawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huchi in kumpipa Rehoboam in phutluih nasemte heutu Adoram a sawl hi. Israel tengteng in suang in a na deng ua, a sita hi. huaiziak in, Jerusalem a tai din kumpipa Rehoboam kintak in a kangtalai ah a tuang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huchi in tunitan in David inkawte tung ah Israelte a na hel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, Israel tengteng in Jeroboam a hong kiknawn chih a zak un, kikaihkhawmna a hoh din a samsak ua, Israelte tung ah kumpipa in a bawl uhi. Judah nam chihlouh David inkawte zui kuamah a omkei uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Jerusalem a tuntakin Rehoboam in Israel inkawte dou a Solomon tapa Rehoboam gamla nawn din Judah inkuan tengteng leh Benjamin nam apan mi hangsan a telkhiak, nuai khat leh sing giat a kaikhawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Himahleh Pathian mi Shemaiah kiang ah Pathian thu a hongtung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Judah gam kumpipa Solomon tapa Rehoboam kiang ah leh Judah leh Benjamin inkuan tengteng kiang ah leh midang teng kiang ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Toupa’n hichi in a chi, “Va hohtou kei un. Israel suan, na unaute vadou kei un. Na inn chiat uah pai nawn vek un. Hiai kei thilhih ahi, chi’n gen in” a chi hi. Huchi in Toupa thu a zui ua, Toupa thu bang in a kiknawn ua, a pai nawn vekta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Huchi in Jeroboam in Ephraim tanggam ah Sekem khua a sat a, huai ah a teng hi. Huai apan a pawtkhia a, Penuel khua a sat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Jeroboam in a lungtang in, “Lalgam David inkawte a honghi nawn diam aw” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Hiai mite Jerusalem a Toupa inn a kithoihnate lan dia a hoh touh uleh a lungtang un a toupa uh, Rehoboam, Judah gam kumpipa lam ah a awn nawn mai ding. Huchi in kei a honthat ding ua, Judah gam kumpipa Rehoboam lam ah a belhnawn mai ding uh” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Kumpipa’n mi a dong a, dangkaeng in bawngnou lim nih a bawl a; a kiang uah, “Nou adin Jerusalem a hohtouh a haksa lawtel hi. Aw, Israel en dih uh, Aigupta gam apan nou hon pikhia na pathiante uh” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Huchi in khat Bethel ah a koih a, khat pen Dan ah a koih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Mipite lah hiai bawngnou lim khat be din Dan tanpha a vapai ziak un hiai khelhna a hong hita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Munsang ah innte a lam a, Levi suante hilou, mi niampente lak a mi siampu in a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Jeroboam in Judah gam a Ankuanglui a neih mah bang un kha giatna, huai kha ni sawmlehnga ni Ankuanglui ni din a sep hi. Maitam ah a hohtou a; Bethel ah a bawngnou lim kiang ah a kithoih hi. Munsang a bawlte ah siampute sep in Bethel ah a koih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Aman a deih bang a, a seh kha mah, kha giatna, ni sawmlehnga ni’n Bethel a maitam a bawl ah a hohtou hi. Israel suante adin Ankuangluina a sep a, maitam a gimlim hal din a hohtou hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, ngai in, Toupa thu in Judah gam apan Pathian mi khat Bethel ah a honghi. Jeroboam maitam chin ah gimlim hal di’n a na ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aman Toupa thu in maitam a kikou khum a, “Maitam aw, maitam, Toupa hichi in a chi. ‘Ngai in, David inkuan ah tapa, a min Josiah a hong piang dia, aman na tung a gimlim halna munsang a siampute na tung ah a lan dia, na tung ah mihing guhte a hal ding’ ” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huai ni mah in chiamtehna a pia hi. “Hiai Toupa chiamtehna ding a chih ahi. Ngai in, maitam a hong khangkham dia, a tung a meivute a hong bawvek ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, Pathian mi in Bethel a maitam a kikou khum thu kumpipa’n a zak in, Jeroboam in, “Manun” chi’n maitam apan a khut in a sawk hi. Mat tuma a sawkna khut a zawta a, a khut a kai kiknawn theita kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian min Toupa thu a chiamtehna dia a gen bang in maitam leng a khangkhama, maitam a meivute leng a bawvek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kumpipa’n a dawng a, Pathian mi kiang ah, “Ka khut a hong damnawn theihna din Toupa na Pathian hehpihna ngen inla, hon thumsak in” a chi hi. Pathian min Toupa kiang ah a ngen a, Kumpipa khut a hong damnawn a, a malam a bangmah in a hongom nawnta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huchi in Kumpipa’n Pathian mi kiang ah, “Ka inn ah kei toh i pai dia hong kihihhalh tadih inla, huchi in kipahman k’on pe ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pathian mi’n kumpipa kiang ah, “Na inn kimkhat zah honpe ding himah lechin leng na kiang ah k’ong pai tuankei ding, hiai ah tanghou ne in tui himhim leng ka dawnsam kei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tanghou va ne in tui himhim leng va dawn kenla, ‘na va hohna lampi ah leng kiknawn ken chi a Toupa thu a sawl ka hi’ ” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huchi in lampi dang ah a pai a, Bethel a a hong kuanna lampi ah a paita kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bethel ah zawlnei putek khat a om hi. A tapate’n huai ni a Bethel a Pathian mi thilhih tengteng a hilh vek uhi. Kumpipa kiang a a thu gente leng a pa uh a hilhlai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A pa un a kiang uah, “Koi lampi a tawn a?” a chi hi. A tapate’n Judah gam apan hongpai Pathian mi painawnna lampi a kawkmuh uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huchi in a tapate kiang ah, “Sabiltung hon bawlsak dih uh” a chi hi. Sabiltung a bawlsak ua; a tung ah a tuangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pathian mi a delhta a, tawsaw sing nuai a tuin a va mu hi. A kiang ah, “Nang na hi maw Judah gam apan hongpai Pathian mi?” a chi hi. Aman, “Hi e” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huchi in aman a kiang ah, “Ka inn ah kei toh hongpai inla; tanghou hong ne dihve” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aman, “Nang toh kiknawn thei ka hi kei, na kiang a hongthei leng ka hi sam kei. Hiai ah na kiang ah thanghou ne in tui himhim leng ka dawn sam kei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tanghou va ne in tui himhim leng va dawn kenla, na va hohna lampi ah leng kiknawn ken, chi a Toupa thu a hilhlah ka hi ngal a” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aman a kiang ah, “Keileng nangmah bang a zawlnei ka hi. Angel in Toupa thu in, tanghoute ne a tuite dawn din na inn ah pi kiknawn in, chi in a hon houpih hi” a chi hi. Himahleh a kiang ah zuau a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huchi in a kiang ah a kiknawn a, a inn ah tanghoute ne in tui a dawnta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, dohkan a umlai un, a pi kiknawnpa zawlnei kiang ah Toupa thu a hongtung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huchi in Judah gam apan hongpai Pathian mi kiang ah, Toupa’n hichi in a chi. “ Toupa thugen manglou a, Toupa na Pathian in thu a honpiak na zuihlouh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />hong kiknawn a, tanghou ne in tui leng dawn ken, ka chihna mun mahmah a tanghou ne a, tui na dawn ziak in na luang na pute han a koih ahi kei ding” chi in a genkheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, tanghou ne a, tui a dawn zoh in, zawlnei a pi kiknawnpa’n sabiltung a bawlsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Huchi in a paita a lamkal ah humpinelkai toh a kituak ua, a na thatta hi. A luang lampi ah a kipai a, sabiltung a kiang ah ading a, humpinelkai leng siluang kiang ah ading hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ngai in, mi a vapai ua, lampi a siluang kipai leh siluang kiang a humpinelkai ding a mu ua; zawlnei putek tenna khua ah a vagen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Lam kal apan vapikik nawnpa zawlnei in huai thu a na zaktak in, “Pathian mi, Toupa thugen mang nuam loupa eive. Huchi in Toupa’n a kiang a, a gen, a thu bangbang a Toupa’n humpinelkai kiang a pia a, a na ham a, a na keilumta eive” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A tapate kiang ah, “Sabiltung hon bawlsak dih uh” chi in a gen a; a bawlsak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Huchi in a kuanta a, a luang lampi a kipai leh sabiltung leh humpinelkai a luang kiang a ding a va mu hi. Humpinelkai in luang a na ne nai kei a, sabiltung leng a na ham kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Zawlnei in Pathian mi luang a dom a, sabiltung tung ah a koih a, a kikpihta hi. Huchi in zawlnei putek tenna khua ah sun ding leh vui din a la lutta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A luang amah han ah a sial a; “Ka unaupa khawk hina mah e!” chi’n a sun uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, a vui khitnung in a tapate kiang ah, “Ka sih chiang in Pathian mi kivuina han ah hon vuisam un. A guhte kiang ah ka guhte koih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Pathian thu a Bethel a maitam leh, Samaria gam khopite a munsangte inn tengteng a kikou khumna thu hongtung ngeingei ding ahi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Huai thilzoh in Jeroboam in a omdan diklou a tawpsan tuankei hi. Mi niampente lak a munsang siampu dia a bawl siampute a om theihna ding un a deihdeih a hihtuam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Huai thil Jeroboam inkuan khelhna amau in-gam saktu leh khovel apan hihmangthangtu a hong hita.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huailai in Jeroboam tapa Abijah a china hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jeroboam in a zi kiang ah, “Thou inla, Jeroboam zi na hi chih a hon theihtheih louhna ding un ki hihlamdang inla, Shiloh ah vahoh dih; ngai in, huai ah zawlnei Ahijah, hiai mite tung a kumpipa dia k’ong om ding ka tungtang thu genpa a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tanghoubeu sawm leh tanghou pei lianloute leh khuaizu thawl khat tawi inla, a kiang ah vahoh dih. Naupang omdan ding hon na hilh ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jeroboam zi in huchibang in a hih a, a thou a, Shiloh ah a hoh a, Ahijah inn ah a va hohta hi. Ahijah in khua a muthei nawn kei a; a upat ziak in a mitlah a mialta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Toupa’n Ahijah kiang ah, “Ngai in, Jeroboam zi a tapa tungtang a thu dong din a hong. A chi a na a, hichibang in na hilh ding ahi. Hichi ahi ding a, a honglut chiang in numei dang hileh kilawmtak in a hong kibawl ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, Ahijah in a honglut lai a khesik ging a na zak tak in, “Nang Jeroboam zi honglut dihve. Bang a chia ahia midang a na kibawl? Tanchin hoihlou tak nang honhilh dia sawl ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pai nawn inla, Jeroboam kiang ah, Toupa’n , Israelte Pathian in hichi in a chi. Mipite lak apan k’on tawisang a, ka mi Israelte tung ah heutu in k’on bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />David inkuante gam ka sut a, huai nang k’on pia hi. Himahleh nang ka sikha David bang in na omkei. Aman zaw ka thupiakte a zui a, ka mitmuh a thil hoih kia hih tum in a lungtang tengteng in a honzui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Himahleh nang bel na ma a mite tengteng sang in thil na hihkhial mahmah se a, n’on hehsakna din pathian dangte leh milim sunte na bawl a, n’on nungngatsanta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huaiziak in, ngai in, Jeroboam inkuan tung ah thil hoihlou ka tungsak dia, Jeroboam apan ta pasal taphot Israel gam a mi nehden leh den louh leng ka hihmang dia, min ek a phiatsiang sipsip bang in Jeroboam inkuan a gamvek masiah ka phiatmang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jeroboam inkaw lak a mi, khopi a si peuhmahte ui in a ne dia; gam a si peuhmahte tung a leng vasate’n a ne ding uh. Hiai Toupa’n a genkhinta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huchi in, thou inla na inn ah pai nawn mai in, khopi sung na siktakin huai naupang a si ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huchi in Israel tengteng in a sun ding ua, a vui ding uh. Jeroboam inkawte lak ah amah kia han a koih ahi ding hi. Jeroboam inkaw lak ah amah kia a Toupa Israelte Pathian lam a thil hoih omsun ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Toupa’n Amah adia Israelte tung a kumpipa hi ding; Jeroboam inkuan hihmang ding mi khat a tungkhe ding hi. Himahleh bang eita? Huai ni ding, tu mah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Toupa’n lah tui a phaiphek lingling bang mai in Israelte a honsat ling dia; huchi in Toupa hehsak a Asherte uh a bawl ziak un a pute uh a na piaksa, hiai gam hoihtak apan Israelte a botkhe siangvek dia, luikhen lam ah a hon hihzak vek ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Israelte thil hihkhial sak a, a hih Jeroboam khelhnate ziak in Israelte a lehngatsan ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jeroboam zi a thou a, a pawtkhia a, Tirzah khua a vatung a; inn kongpi bul a tuntak in huai naupang a sita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Toupa’n a sikha zawlnei Ahijah zang a thu a gen bang ngei in Israel tengteng in a vui ua, a sunta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jeroboam tanchin dang, a galdou thute leh a vaihawm thute, ngai in, Israel kumpipate vaihawm lai thugelhna bu ah a tuang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huchi in Jeroboam vaihawm sung kum sawmnih leh nih ahi a, a pute kiang ah a ihmuta a, a tapa Nadab amah sik in a hong lalta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Solomon tapa Rehoboam Judah gam ah a lal hi. A lal tung lai in Rehoboam kum sawmli leh khat a upa ahi. Toupa’n a min omsakna dia Israel nam tengtengte lak a a tel khopi Jerusalem ah kum sawmlehsagih a lal hi. A nu min Naamah ahi a, amah Ammon mi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Judahte’n Toupa mitmuh in thil gilou a hih ua; a pute uh thilhih tengteng khup in a khelhnate un a mullitna a tokthou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tangsang teng ah leh sing hing teng nuai ah suangphuhte phut in mun sangte leh Asherte nangawn a bawl ngal ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Huai gam ah pasal kizuakte leng a om ua; Israel suante ma a Toupa’n a delhkhiak namte thilhih kihhuai chiteng a hihsamta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Kumpipa Rehoboam lal kum nga kum in hichi ahi a, Aigupta kumpipa Shishak in Jerusalem a sual hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Toupa inn a goute leh kumpipa inn a goute a la a, avek in a la khin hi. Solomon dangkaeng lum bawl tengteng leng a la telvek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Kumpipa Rehoboam in huaite tang in dal lumte a bawl a, kumpipa inn kongpi vengmi heutute a kem sak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, Toupa inn a kumpipa a lut peuhmah chiang in vengmite’n huaite a tawi ua, dantan ah a koih nawn zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Rehoboam tanchin dangte leh a thilhih tengteng Judah kumpipate lal lai thugelhna bu ah a tuang kei maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Rehoboam leh Jeroboam a damsung teng un a kidou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Huchi in Rehoboam a pute kiang ah a ihmuta a, David khopi ah a pute lak ah a vuita uh. A nu min Naamah ahi a, Ammon mi ahi. A tapa Abijam a sik in a hong lalta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan Nebat tapa kumpipa Jeroboam kum sawmlehgiat a lal kum in Judahte tung ah Abijam a lal pan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jerusalem khua ah kum thum a lal a; a nu min Maakah, Absalom tanu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A ma apan thil gilou a hih tengteng a hihsam ahi. A pu David bang in a lungtang Toupa a Pathian lam ah a hoihkim sam kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Himahleh David ziak in Toupa a Pathian in a nung a, a tapa hong dinkhiakna ding leh Jerusalem khua ding kip sak din Jerusalem khua ah khawnvak a pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hit mi Uriah tungtang chihlouh in David in Toupa mitmuh a thil hoih a hih ziak leh a damsung teng a hih dia thu a piak peuhmah a sel ngeilouh ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Rehoboam a damsung teng Jeroboam toh a kidou gige uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Abijam tanchin dangte leh a thilhih tengteng Judah kumpipate lal lai thugelhna bu ah a tuang ka hia? Abijah leh Jeroboam a kidou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Abijam a pute kiang ah a ihmuta a; David khopi ah a vui uhi. A ma sik in a tapa Asa a lalta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Israel kumpipa Jeroboam kum sawmnih a lal kum in Asa bel Judahte tung ah a lal pan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kum sawmli leh khat Jerusalem ah a lal a; a nu min Maakah ahi a, amah Abishalom tanu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Asa in a pu David mah bang in Toupa mitmuh in thil hoih a hih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pasal kizuakte gam apan a delhkhia a; a pute’n milim a na bawl tengteng uh a lamang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A nu Maakah leng, milim kihhuai mahmah Asher a bawlsak ziak in, a kumpinu hihna a tawpsak hi. A milim bawl a hihsia a, Kidron lui ah a hal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Munsangte ahihleh a lamang kei a; himahleh Asa lungtang a damsung teng in Toupa lam ah a hoih bukim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Apan thil a na latsate leh amahmah in a na latsa dangka, dangkaeng leh tuium-belsuan Toupa inn ah a lalut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Asa leh Israel kumpipa Baasha lal sungteng a kidou gige uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Israel kumpipa Baasha in Judah a va dou a, Judah kumpipa Asa kiang a lut ding leh pawtkhe ding dalna din Ramah khua a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huchi in Asa in Toupa inn leh kumpipa inn a gou omlai dangka leh dangkaeng tengteng a la a, a sikhate a pia hi. Huchi in kumpipa Asa in Damaska a om Suria kumpipa Hezion tapate Tabrimon tapa Benhadad kiang ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kei leh nang kikal ah leh ka pa leh na pa kikal ah thukhun a om a; ngai in, thilpiak dangka leh dangkaeng k’on khak hi. Hongpai inla, Israel kumpipa Baasha in a hon paisanna din amah toh na thukhun uh hihsia in, chi in a khak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Benhadad in kumpipa Asa thu a na pom a, Israel khuate dou din a sepaih heutute a sawl a, Ijon, Dan, Abel beth maakah khuate, Kinneroth bial tengteng leh Naphtali gam tengteng tan in a dou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, Baasha in huai thu a na zaktak in Ramah a bawl a tawp a, Tirzah khua ah a tengta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kumpipa Asa in Judah gam tengteng ah thu a thangsak vialvial hi. Kuamah om awl a omkei uh. Huchi in Baasha in Ramah khua bawlna dia suang leh sing a zatte a nawn ua; huaite zang in kumpipa Asa in Mizpah khua leh Benjamin gam a Geba khua a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Asa tanchin dang tengteng, a thilhih dan tengteng, a thilhih tengtengte leh a khobawlte Judah kumpipate lal lai thugelhna bu ah a tuang kei maw? Himahleh a teklam in a khe a hong nata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Huchi in a ihmuta a, a pu David khopi ah a pute lak ah a vui ua; a tapa Jehosaphat a sik in a lal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Jeroboam tapa Nadab Judah kumpipa Asa lal kum nihna ah Israel tung ah a lal pan a, Israel tung ah kum nih a lal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Toupa mitmuh in thil hoihlou tak a hih a, a pa lampi a tawn a, Israelte thilhih a khialsak a, a hihkhelhna pentak aman leng a hihsam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Issakar inkuante lak a mi Ahijah tapa Baasha in amah a guk sawm a, Philistiate tan, Gibbethon khua ah Baasha in a that hi. Nadab leh Israel tengteng in Gibbethon a umlai uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Judah kumpipa Asa lal kum thumna ah ahi Baasha in a thah a, a sik a, a lal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, kumpipa a hong hih in Jeroboam inkaw tengteng a that a; Jeroboam adin kuamah a hinghawi kei hi. Toupa Shiloh khua a mi a sikha Ahijah zang a a gensa bang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Huai bel Israelte thil hihkhial sak a a hih, Jeroboam khelhnate ziak leh Toupa , Israelte Pathian a hehsak ziak ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Nadab tanchin dangte leh a thilhih tengteng Israel kumpipate lal lai thugelhna bu ah a tuang ka hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Asa leh Israel kumpipa Baasha a lal sungteng un a kidou gige uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Judah kumpipa Asa lal kum thum na ah Ahijah tapa Baasha Tirzah ah Israel tengteng tung ah a lal pan a, kum sawmnih leh li a lal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Toupa mitmuh in thilh hoihlou mahmah a hih a, Jeroboam lampi zuih a zui a, Israelte thil hihkhialsak a a hihkhelhna a hihsam hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huchi in Baasha kalh in Hanani tapa Jehu kiang ah Toupa thu a hongtung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Leivui apan k’on domsang a, ka mi Israelte tung ah heutu in k’on bawl hi. Nang Jeroboam lampi zuih na tawn a, a khelhnate a hon hehsak din ka mi Israelte thil na hihkhial sak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ngai in, Baasha leh a inkawte ka hihmang ding hi. Huchi in Nebat tapa Jeroboam inkawte bang mai in na inkawte ka bawl ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Baasha inkawte lak a mi khopi a si peuhmah ui in a ne dia; a inkawte lak a mi gamlak a si peuhmah tungleng vasate’n a ne ding uh” chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Baasha tanchin dangte, a thilhihte leh a thilhih theihdante Israel kumpipate lal lai thugelhna bu ah a tuang kei maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Baasha a pute kiang ah a ihmuta a, Tirzah khua ah a vui ua; a tapa Elah a sik in a lalta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Baasha leh a inkawte tungtang thu ah a khutsuak a Toupa heh sak dia Jeroboam inkawte batna nei a Toupa mitmuh a thil hoihlou mahmah a hih ziak leh amah a thah ziak in Hanani tapa zawlnei Jehu zang a a gen Toupa thu a hongtung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Judah kumpipa Asa lal kum sawmnih leh guk na ah Baasha tapa Elah, Tirzah ah Israelte tung ah a lal pan a, kum nih a lal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A sikha Zimri, a kangtalai kimkhat tung a heutu in Tirzah khua ah amah guk thah a sawm hi. Huchih lai in, Tirzah khua ah inn sung lam heutu Arza inn ah zukham in a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Judah kumpipa Asa lal kum sawmnih leh sagih kum in Zimri a valut a, a sual a, a that a, a sik in a lalta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, a hong lal pan a, a mangtutphah a a hongtut tak in, Baasha inkaw tengteng a thatvek a; a tanaute leh a lawmte lak a mi pasal photphot khat leng a hawikei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huchi in, zawlnei Jehu zang a Baasha kalh a a gen, Toupa thu bang in, Zimri in Baasha inkaw tengteng a thatvek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Toupa , Israelte Pathian, a ginnatlouhna ua hehsak dia, a tohthoh ua, a hihkhelh uh, Baasha khelhnate leh Elah tapa khelhna, huai a Israelte a hih khelhsak ziak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Elah tanchin dangte leh a thilhih tengteng Israel kumpipate lal lai thugelhna bu ah a tuang ka hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Judah kumpipa Asa lal kum sawmnih leh sagih na ah Zimri, Tirzah ah ni sagih a lal hi. Philistiate neihsa, Gibbethon khua a mite’n a um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A um mite’n “Zimri in a guksawm a, kumpipa a that” chih a gen uh a naza ua; huchi in Israel tengteng in sepaih heutu, Omri, huai nin a giahmun uah Israelte tung a kumpipa in a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Omri bel Israel tengteng toh Gibbethon apan in a hohtou ua, Tirzah a va um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, Zimri in khua a la uh chih a theih in, kumpipa inn a kulh ah a tailut a, kumpipa inn ah a kibuhal a, a sita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Toupa mitmuh a thil hoihlou mahmah hih a a khelhnate ziak leh Jeroboam lampi tawn a Israelte thil hihkhial sak a, a khelh ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Zimri tanchin dangte leh a sawmgukna thute Israel kumpipate lal lai thugelhna bu ah a tuang kei maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huchi in Israel mite pawl nih in a kikhenta ua; mipi kimkhat in Ginath tapa Tibni kumpipa dia bawl tum in a zui ua; a kimkhat in Omri a zui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Himahleh Omri zuite’n Ginath tapa Tibni zuite a zou ua: huchi in Tibni a si a, Omri a hong lalta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Judah kumpipa Asa lal kum sawmthum leh khatna ah Omri Israelte tung ah a lal pan a, kum sawmlehnih a lal a: Tirzah ah kum guk a lal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Shemer a Samaria tang dangka talent nih in a lei a; tang ah khua a sat a, a khosat min huai neipa Shemer mintam in Samaria a sa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Omri in Toupa mitmuh in thil hoihlou mahmah a hih a, a ma a mi tengteng sang in thil a hihkhial thupi tuamse hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Nebat tapa Jeroboam dan tengteng a la a, a ginnatlouhna ziak ua Toupa , Israelte Pathian hehsak dia Israelte thil a hihkhelh sak bang in a khial samta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Omri thilhih tanchin dangte leh a thilhih theihdan a hihlat thute Israel kumpipate lal lai thugelhna bu ah a tuang ka hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Huchi in Omri a pute kiang ah a ihmuta a, Samaria khua ah a vui ua; a tapa Ahab a sik in a hong lalta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Judah kumpipa Asa lal kum sawmthum leh giatna ah Omri tapa Ahab Israelte tung ah a lal pan hi. Omri tapa Ahab Samaria ah kum sawmnih leh nih Israelte tung ah a lal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Omri tapa Ahab in a ma a mi tengteng sang in Toupa mitmuh in thil hoihlou mahmah a hih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, Nebat tapa Jeroboam khelhna bang hih sam bangmahlou a ngai hileh kilawm tak in, Zidonte kumpipa Eth baal tanu Jezebel zi in a nei a, Baal na sem in a be samta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Samaria a Baal inn a lam ah Baal adin maitam a doh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ahab in Aserah a bawl a; a ma a Israel kumpipa tengteng sang in Ahab in Toupa , Israelte Pathian hehsakna thil a nak hih tungtuan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />A lal lai in Bethel mi Hiel in Jeriko khua a sat a; a ta chil Abiram tanloh in a suangphum a phum hi. A nautum Segub tanloh hial in a kulh kongkhakte ading khesak a, Toupa’n Nun tapa Joshua zang a a na gensa bang in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan Gilead gam a Tishbi khua a mi Elijah in Ahab kiang ah, “ Toupa , a ma a ka dinna Israelte Pathian hinna lou in ka gen hi. Keimah thu lou in kum bangzah hiam sung daitui leh vuah a zukei ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Toupa thu a kiang ah a hongtung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Hiai apan pawt inla, suahlam zuan in pai inla, Jordan gei a om Kerith lui ah va kibu in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hichi ahi ding a, Huai luitui na dawn dia; huai ah nang hon vak din va-ak thu ka pekhin hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huchi in a kuan a, Toupa thu bang in a hihta hi. Jordan gei a om Kerith lui ah a tengta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Va-akte’n zingsang in tanghou leh sa a hong puakzel ua, nitaklam in tanghou leh sa a hong puaknawn zel uhi. Huai luitui a dawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A nung deuh in hichi ahi a, huai gam a vuah himhim a zuk louh ziak in lui a hong kangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Toupa thu a kiang ah a hongtung a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Thou inla, Zidon gam a Zarephath khua ah hoh inla, huai ah om in. Nang honvak din meithai khat thu ka pekhin” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huchi in a thou a, Zarephath khua ah a hohta hi. Huai khaw kulh kongpi a tun in, ngai in, meithai khat sing tom a na om a; amah a sam a, “Bel in tui tawmchik honla dihve, ka na dawn ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />La dia kuan a sam a, “Tanghou neuchik bek hontawi lechin” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aman, Toupa na Pathian hinna lou in, ka gen hi. “Tanghou ka neikei, bel ah tangbuang pham khat lel leh thawl ah sathau tawmchik kia ka nei hi. Ngai in, ka pai chia ka tapa adia bawlna ding singkang nih hiam lel ka tom a, huchi in ka ne ding ua, ka simai ding uh” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Elijah in a kiang ah, “Lau ken, na gen bang in va hih in. Himahleh huai in tanghou neuchik petmah hon bawlsak phot inla, huai hontawi inla, huaikhit chiang in nang ading leh na tapa ading na bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Toupa , Israelte Pathian in hichi in a chi. Toupa’n leitung a vuah a hon zuksak masiah tangbuang bel a vuak tuankei dia, sathau thawl leng a kangkei ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huchi in, Elijah gen bang in a hih a; amah leh a inkawte leh Elijah toh ni tamtak a ne uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Elijah zang a a gen Toupa thu bang in tangbuang bel a vuak tuankei a, sathau thawl leng a kang sam kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huai thilte nung in hichi ahi a, huai numei, inn neinu tapa china in a hong gim mahmah a, a nak a hong beita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aman Elijah kiang ah, “Nang Pathian mi aw, ka tung a lungkim louhna bang nei na hia? Ka khelhna hon thei khesak ding leh ka tapa hon thahsak dia hongpai neive!” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aman a kiang ah, “Na tapa honpia in” a chi hi. Huchi in a pom lai a la a, a omna dantan ah a pom tou a, a lupna ah a sial hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Toupa a sam a, “Aw Toupa , ka Pathian, ka tenna meithainu tung ah leh a tapa hihlupsak in thil hoihlou hon tungsakta na hi maw?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huchi in, naupang tung ah thumvei bokkhup in, Toupa a sam a, “Aw Toupa, ka Pathian, hehpih in hiai naupang hinna asung ah hon omsak nawn in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Toupa’n Elijah thu a na ngaihkhiak sak hi. Hichi in naupang hinna amah sung ah a hongom nawn a, a hong halhnawnta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Elijah in naupang a pi a, dantan apan inn sung ah a paipih suk a, a nu a pia hi. Elijah in, “En in, na tapa a hing hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Numei in Elijah kiang ah, “Tuin Pathian mi na hi a, na kam a Toupa thu thutak ahi” chih ka theita, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, ni sawtkuamtak nung in hichi ahi a, a kum thum kum in Toupa thu Elijah kiang ah a hongtung hi. “Vakuan inla, Ahab kiang ah va kihil in. Huchi in leitung ah vuah ka zusak ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Elijah Ahab kiang a kihil din a kuanta hi. Samaria gam ah kial a na mahmah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahab in Obadiah, a in sunglam heutu a sam hi. Obadiah bel Toupa laudan siam mahmah mi ahi a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, Jezebel in Toupa zawlneite a satkhiak lai in Obadiah in zawlnei za khat a pi a, kawkhuk ah sawmnga nga in a sel a, tanghou leh tui in a vak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahab in Obadiah kiang ah, “Tui naknei tengteng leh luiguam tengteng omna gam vatuan vialvial dihve. Sakol leh sabiltungte i hut hing theihna din loupa i muhsak theikha hiam, huchilou in zaw gante i tanvek kha ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huchi in gam totsuak ding in a kihawm ua; Ahab amah kia in lampi dang ah a pai a, Obadiah leng amah kia in lampi dang ah a pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huchi a Obadiah a pailai in, ngai in, Elijah in a natuak a; aman a theilai a, huchi in a khupboh a, “Ka toupa Elijah na hi maw?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aman a dawng a, “Hi e, kuan inla, ngai in, Elijah huai ah a om hi, chi’n na toupa vahilh in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aman, “Thil bang ahia ka hihkhelh a, na sikha thah dia Ahab khut a na honpiak ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian hinna lou in ka gen ahi, ka pu in nang a hon zonsak louhna nam leh gam himhim a omkei. Hiai ah a omkei, a chih chiang un nang a hon muhlouhna thu uah gam leh nam a kichiamsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuin nang, kuan inla, ngai in, Elijah hiai ah a om, chi’n na toupa vahilh in, na chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hichi ahi ding a, nang k’on nutsiattakin Toupa Kha in ka theihlouhna ah nang a hong lamang dia; huchi in Ahab ka va hilh a, nang a hon muhtheih ngal kenzaw, kei a hon that mai ding hi. Himahleh na sikha in ka valnou tung apan Toupa ka lau hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Jezebel in Toupa zawlneite a thahlai a ka thilhih, Toupa zawlneite lak a mi za khat, sawmnga nga a kawkhuka, tanghou leh tui a ka vak dan ka toupa hon hilhlou uhia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuin nang, kuan inla, ngai in, Elijah huai ah a om hi, chi’n na toupa va hilh in na chimawk a; aman kei a honthat mahmah ding, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Elijah in, a ma ka dinna sepaihte Toupa hinna lou in ka gen hi, tuni in a kiang ah ka kihil ngeingei ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huchi in Ahab houpih din Obadiah a kuan a, a hilhta a; huchi in Elijah mu din Ahab a kuanta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, Ahab in Elijah a muh in Ahab in a kiang ah, “Nang na hi maw, Israelte buaisakpa?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aman a dawng a, “Israelte ka buaisak kei. Nang leh na pa inkawte eive a buaisak zaw. Toupa thupiakte lehngatsan a, Baal na zuihzawk na ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huchi in tuin Israel tengteng leh Baal zawlnei za li leh sawmnga leh Asher zawlnei, Jezebel dohkan a Ankuang um za lite ka kiang ah Karmel tang ah va samkhawm in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huchi in Ahab in Israel suan tengteng kiang ah mi a sawl a, zawlneite Karmel tang ah a samkhawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Elijah in mipi tengteng a vanaih a, “Vanglak a bang tan om ding na hi ua? Toupa Pathian ahihleh, Amah zui unla; Baal ahihleh amah zui un” a chi hi. Mipite’n kam khat in leng a dawng kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huchi in, Elijah in mipite kiang ah, “ Toupa zawlnei omsun kei kia ka hi a; Baal zawlneite bel mi za li leh sawmnga ahi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Huchi in bawngtal nih hongpia uhenla; amau bawngtal khat amau a tuam din tel uhenla, sem nen uhenla, singtung ah koih uhenla, a nuai ah mei tohlou in. Ken leng bawngtal khat ka bawl sam dia, sing tung ah ka koih dia mei ka toh sam kei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nou na pathiante min uh sam unla, ken Toupa min ka sam ding. Huchi in mei a hon dawng Pathian pen Pathian hi hen, a chi hi. Huchi in mi tengteng in a thugen a hoih hi” chi’n a dawng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Elijah in Baal zawlneite kiang ah, “Nou bawngtal khat nou a tuam din tel unla, bawl masa un; nou na tamdeuh ua; na pathiante min sam unla, himahleh a nuai ah mei toh kei un” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Bawngtal a tan pen uh a la ua, a bawl ua, “Baal aw, hon dawng in” chi in zingsang apan sun tan in Baal min a sam uh. Himahleh aw a omkei a, a dawng leng a omsam kei a, maitam kibawl tung ah a tawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Sunlai in hichi ahi a, “Elijah in amau enghou in, kikou ngaih ve ua; pathian khat ahi ngal a. Midang houpih hiam, nungdelh neilel hiam, khualzin ahihkeileh ihmu lel phawn teitei ngai houh hinte” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Huchi in a ngaih a ngaih in a kikou ua, a hihzel dan bang un sisan pawt khop hial in temta in a ki atkeh ua, thilzum in a kisun uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Sun nung a hong hih in hichi ahi a, nitaklam kithoih hun tan in thu a gen uhi. Himahleh aw hiam, dawngtu hiam limsaktu leng a omkei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Huchi in Elijah in mipi tengteng kiang ah, “Hongnai dih ua” a chi hi. Huchi in mipi tengteng in a vanaih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Toupa maitam kichimsa a bawlpha a; na min Israel ahi ding, chi a Toupa thu a na mupa Jakob tate nam zah suang sawmlehnih Elijah in a la hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Huai suangte in Toupa min in maitam a bawl a; maitam kim buhchi tehna nih takna ding a toukuak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Sing a koih hoih sipsip a, bawngtal a semnen a, singtung ah a koih hi. “Bel li tui in dimsak unla, haltum thillat leh sing buakun” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />A nihveina din “Buaknawn un” a chi a; a buaknawn uhi. A thumveina din “Buaknawn un,” a chi a, a buaknawn uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Huchi in tui maitam kim ah a luang zuazua a; tohkuak tui in a dimta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Nitaklam kithoih hun in hichi ahi a, zawlnei Elijah in a va naih a, “ Toupa Abraham, Isak leh Israel Pathian, nang Israel gam a Pathian na hihleh, kei na sikha ka hih, hiai tengteng nang thu a ka hih tuni in theih sak hi hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Hon ngaikhia in, Aw Toupa hon ngaikhia in, hiai mipite’n nang Toupa Pathian na hi a, a lungtang uh na heikik nawnta chih a theihna ding un” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Huchi in, Toupa mei a hong kia a, haltum thillat, a sing, a suang leh a leivui a kangtum a, tohkuak a tui a hipkang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Huchi in mipi tengteng in huai a muh un a khupboh ua, “ Toupa Amah Pathian ahi, Toupa Amah Pathian ahi” a chi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Elijah in a kiang uah, Baal zawlneite man unla, khat leng suaktasak kei un, a chi hi. Huchi in a man ua, Elijah in Kishon lui ah a pi suk a, huai ah amau a that hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Elijah in Ahab kiang ah, paitou inla, ne in dawnta in; vuahpi zu ding husa a om, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Ahab ne leh dawn di’n a paitouta hi. Elijah bel Karmel tang vum ah a paitou a; lei ah a kunsuka, a khukte kikal ah a mai a phual hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />A sikha kiang ah, “Va paitou inla, tuipi lam va en mahdih!” a chi hi. A va paitou a, tuipi lam a en a; “Bangmah a omkei ” a chi hi. Aman sagihvei kuannawn in, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />A sagihvei na ah hichi ahi a, ngai in, tuipi apan mihing khuttum chia lel meipi a leng tou viaiviai, a chi hi. Aman vapai inla, Ahab kiang ah, na kangtalai bawl inla, paisukta in, vuah in a honkhum kha ding, chi in, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Sawtlou nung in hichi ahi a, huih leh meipite in van a dup keih kuih a, vuahpi petmah a hongzuta hi. Ahab kangtalai a tuang in Jezreel khua ah a paita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Toupa khut Elijah tung ah a om a; a puan a teng a, Ahab ma ah Jezreel kholutna tan a taita hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, Ahab in Elijah thilhih tengteng, namsau a zawlnei tengteng a thah thute toh Jezebel a hilh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huchi in Jezebel in Elijah kiang ah, “Huai mite lak a mi khat hinna bang a zingchiang a hichi hun ma a na hinna k’on bawlsak sam kei leh pathiante’n a lohloh uh honloh uhenla, huai sang a sezaw in leng” chi a hilh din mi a sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huchi in huai a theih in a lau a, a thou a, a hinna humbit din a tai hi. Judah gam a Beer–sheba khua a va tung a, huai ah a sikha a nusia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amah gamdai ah ni khat lampaina tan ah a hoh a, Juniper sing nuai ah a tuin sih a ngenta hi. “A hunta hi; Toupa aw, tuin ka hinna la in, ka pute sang in lah ka hoihzaw tuankei” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Juniper sing nuai ah a lum a, a ihmuta hi. Ngai in, angel in a hong khoih a, a kiang ah, “Thou inla ne in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aman a en vialvial a, ngai in, a lu chin ah tanghou pei, suangsa a haiminsa leh tuithawl a na om hi. Huchi in hiaite ne in a dawn a, a lum nawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Toupa angel a nihveina din a hongpai nawn a, a hong khoih a, “Thou inla, ne in, Na paina ding a gamla lawlai hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huchi in a thou a, ne in a dawn a, an ziak a hatna in Pathian tang Horeb tan ni sawmli leh zan sawmli a pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huai a kawkhuk khat a vatung a, huai ah a omta hi. Ngai in, Toupa thu a kiang ah a hongtung a, a kiang ah, “Hiai a bang hih na hia, Elijah?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aman, “ Toupa , sepaihte Pathian adin phatuam ka ngai mahmah hi. Israel suante’n lah na thukhun a lehngatsan ua, na maitamte a chimsak ua, na zawlneite namsau in a that ngal ua. A omlai kei kia ka hi a, ka hinna lakmang din a zong uhi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aman, “Pawtkhia inla, huai tang ah Toupa ma ah va ding in” a chi hi. Ngai in, Toupa a hongpai a, huihpi hat mahmah in tangte Toupa ma ah a mut khang a, suangpi a kitam phuakphuak hi. Himahleh huai ah Toupa a omkei. Huih nun khit in zin a hongling a; himahleh huai zinling ah Toupa a omkei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Zinlin khit in mei a hongpawt a; himahleh huai mei ah Toupa a omkei. Mei nung in aw ngat ngiingei a hongpawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, Elijah in huai a zak in a puanin a mai a khuha, va pawtkhia in kawkhuk lutna ah a va ding hi. Ngai in, huai aw in a kiang ah, “Hiai a bang hih na hia, Elijah?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aman, “ Toupa , sepaihte Pathian adin phatuam ka ngai mahmah hi. Israel suante’n lah na thukhun a lehngatsan ua, na maitamte a chimsak ua, na zawlneite namsau in a that ua. A omlai kei ka hi a, ka hinna lakmang din a zong uhi” a chi hi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Toupa’n a kiang ah, “Pai nawn inla, gamdai lam a Damaska khua ah pai in. Na tun chiang in Suria kumpipa din Hazael thau na nilh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Israel kumpipa din Nimshi tapa Jehu thau na nilh ding; na sik a zawlnei din Abel meholah khua a mi Shaphat tapa Elisha leng thau na nilh ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hichi ahi ding a, Hazael namsau pel peuhmah Jehu in a that dia; Jehu namsau pel peuhmah Elisha in a that ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Himahleh Israel gam ah Baal ma a khukdin ngeilou leh amah tawp ngeilou mi sang sagih kei adin ka sit hi” a chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huchi in huai apan a pawtkhia a, Shaphat tapa Elisha a va mukhia hi. Aman langkawn bat bawngtal tuak sawmlehnih in lou a na kai hi. A sawmlehnihna a zang hi. Elijah in a va naih a, a puan a va silhsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aman a bawngtalte paisan in Elijah a nungdelh a, “Ka nu leh ka pa hon tawpsak din k’on ngen, huchi in k’on zui ding” a chi hi. Aman a kiang ah, “Pai nawn ve leh, bang k’on chih a eita?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amah zuilai a kiknawn a, bawng tuakkhat a gou a, bawng vante in a sa a huan a, mite a pia a, amau a ne uhi. Huchi in a thou a, Elijah a delh a, a na a sepsakta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, Suria kumpipa Benhadad in a sepaih tengteng a kaikhawm vek a, kumpipa sawmthum leh nih a tel ua, sakol leh kangtalaite toh a kuantou a, Samaria khua a va um a, a douta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel kumpipa Ahab kiang ah khopi sung ah mi a sawl a, a kiang ah, Benhadad in hichi in a chi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Na dangka leh dangkaeng kei a ahi. Na zite leh na tate, na neih hoihpente tan in leng kei a ahi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Israel kumpipa’n a na dawng a, “Ka toupa, kumpipa aw, na gen bang in kei leh ka neih tengteng nang a ahi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A mi sawlte a pai nawn ua, Benhadad in hichi in a chi, “Ka kiang a na dangka leh dangkaeng, na zite leh na tate n’on piak ding ahi, chi in mi honsawl ding ka hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />‘Zingchiang hiai hun in ka sikhate na kiang ah k’on sawl dia, na inn leh na sikhate inn a hong mai ding uh.’ Hichi ahi ding a, na mit late a la ding ua, a hon paipih vek ding uh” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Israel kumpipa’n a gam a upa tengteng a sam a, thei un, “Hiai min thil hoihloutak hih a tupdan. Ka kiang ah mi a honsawla, ka zite, ka tate, ka dangka leh ka dangkaeng a hong ngen a, amah ka na nialkei hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Upa tengteng leh mipi tengteng in a kiang ah, “Amah na limsak dah inla, a ngette leng pesam ken” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Benhadad misawlte kiang ah, “Kumpipa, ka toupa kiang ah, na sikha kiang a misawl a na honnget masak tengteng bang in ka hihdia; himahleh hiai zaw ka hih kei ding” a chi, chi un. Huchi in a misawlte a pai nawn ua, huai thu a va tun uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Benhadad in a kiang ah mi a sawl nawn a, “Kei honzui teng in a khut dim ua a pham dia kiching Samaria khaw leivui nutsiat ahihleh pathiante’n a lohloh honloh uhenla, huai sang a sezaw in leng” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Israel kumpipa’n a dawng a, “Mi a kigalvan khinsa, a galvan suah khesa bang in kiuangsak kei hen, chi in va hilh un” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, amah leh Kumpipate’n puanin a zu a na dawn khawm lai un huai thu Benhadad in a naza a, a mite kiang ah, “Kisa dih ua” a chi hi. Huchi in khua dou din a kisata uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huchi in, ngai in, zawlnei khat in Israel kumpipa Ahab a va naih a, Toupa’n hichi in a chi: “Hiai mipi tampite na mu hia? Ngai in, tuin na khut ah k’on pe ding. Huchi in kei Toupa ka hi, chih na thei ding uh” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahab in, “Kua zang in eita?” a chi hi. Aman, “ Toupa’n hichi in a chi. Gam sehkhente a heutu tangvalte zang in” a chi hi. Aman, “Kuan dou dia thu pe ding eita?” a chi hi. Aman, “Nangmah in” chi in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huchi in aman gam sehkhente a heutu tangvalte a kaikhawm a, za nih leh sawmthum leh nih ahi uh. Huai mite nung in mi tengteng, Israel suan tengteng a kaikhawm a, sang sagih ahi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Sunlai tak in a vapawt ua, Benhadad leh kumpipate, amah panpih kumpipa sawmthum leh nihte huai puanin ah zu dawnkham in a na om uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Gam sehkhente a heutu tangvalte a vapawt masa ua; Benhadad in mi a sawl a, “Amau, Samaria khua apan hongpawt a om uh” chi in a hilh uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aman, “Kilep tuma hong a hih uleh hingmat unla, kidou tuma hong a hih uleh leng hingmat un” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huchi in hiai gam sehkhente a heutu tangvalte leh a honzui sepaihte khua apan a pawt uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A bitum chiat uh a va that ua; huchi in Suriate a taikekta ua, Israelte’n a delh uhi. Huchi in Suria kumpipa Benhadad sakol tung a tuang in sakol tungtuang mite toh a suakta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Israel kumpipa a va pawtkhia a, sakol leh kangtalaite a va sual a, Suriate tampi a that hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Zawlnei in Israel kumpipa a vanaih a, a kiang ah, “Kihat sak inla, na hihdan ding ngaihtuah in kum hong bei leh Suria kumpipa’n hong dou nawn ding ahi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Suria kumpipa sikhate’n a kiang ah, “A pathiante uh tangte pathiante ahi uh. Huaiziak a eisang a amau hatzaw ahi uh. Phaizang ah dou le hang, amau sang in i hatzaw ngeingei ding uh a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hiai thilhih in. Kumpipate avek un lakhia inla, amun uah gamukmite koih in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Sepaihte, sakolte leh kangtalaite, na mansuahsa zah geih sepaihte ding khethak saknawn in. Huchi in phaizang ah i dou ding ua, amau sang in i hatzaw na ding uhi” a chi uh. Aman a thugen uh a ngaikhia a, huchibang in a hihta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A kum nawn in hichi ahi a, Benhadad in Suriate a kaikhawm a, Israelte dou din Aphek ah a hohtou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Israel suante leng a ki kaikhawm ua, nekding a sekkhawm masa ua, dou din a kisata uhi. Israel suante kelnou tawmchik chik hon nih banglel in a va kilang ua; Suriate bel gam ah a pumdim uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Pathian mi’n Israel kumpipa vanaihin, a houpih a, a kiang ah, “ Toupa’n hichi in a chi. Suriate’n, Toupa tangte Pathian ahi a, phaizang Pathian ahi kei, a chi uhi. Huaiziak in, hiai mipi tampite na khut ah k’on pe ding hi, huchi in kei Toupa ka hi, chih na thei ding uh” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ni sagih sungtak a ki nangtuah nilouh uh. Hichi ahi a, a ni sagih ni’n a kidouta ua; Israel suante’n Suria mite ni khat in sepaih nuai khat a that uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Midangte bel Aphek ah, khopi sung ah a tailut ua, omlaite mi sing nih leh sang sagih kulhchimin a chipkhumta hi. Benhadad a tai a, khopi sung ah dantan sunggil ah a lut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A sikhate’n a kiang ah, “Ngai in, Israel inkuan lak a kumpipate mi hehpihthei kumpipate ahi uh chih thu ka za uh. Saiip puan teng in, ka lu ua khau a kikhihin Israel kumpipa kiang ah hon va hohsak in; aman a hon hinghawi nuam khamawh kei ding” a chi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Huchi in saiip puan a teng ua, a lu uah khau in a kikhih ua, Israel kumpipa kiang ah a vahoh ua, “Na sikha Bebhadad in, hehpih in hon hinghawi hen” a chi, a chi uh. Aman, “Damlai ahi maw? Amah Ka unaupa ahi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Huai mite’n lungnuamtakin, a lungsim thutak gen ahi ding chih gingta in, “Na unaupa Benhadad himah e” a chipah uhi. Huchi in aman, “Vapai unla, honpi un” a chi hi. Benhadad a hong pawtkhia a, a kiang ah a hoh a; aman a kangtalai ah a na tuangsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Benhadad in a kiang ah, “Ka pa’n na pa apan khua a na lakte k’on pekik ding. Ka pa’n Samaria khua a sumsinna munte a bawl bang in Damaska khua ah sumsinna munte na bawlsam ding a chi hi. Huchibang a thu kikhung in k’on paisak ding hi” a chi hi. Huchi in a kiang ah thu a khung a, a paisakta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />zawlnei tapate lak a mi khat in Toupa thu in a lawmpa kiang ah, “Honkhen in” a chi a; huai mi in a khen utkei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Huchi in a kiang ah, “ Toupa thu na manlouh ziak in, ngai in, mual n’on khupsantakin, humpinelkai in a hon nakei ding” a chi hi. Mual a khuptakin humpinelkai in a tuak a, a that hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Huchi in midang a vamu nawn a, “Honkhen in,” a chi a; huai mi in a khen a, a liamta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Huchi in zawlnei a pai a, lampi ah kumpipa a na tang a, a mai a vut nuh in a na kibawl lamdang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Kumpipa a hongtun in kumpipa a na sam a, “Kei na sikha kidouna lak ah ka tailut a; ngai in, mi khat a hong kilehhei a, ka kiang ah mi khat a honpi a, hiai mi na veng in, a taimang leh a hinna sik in na hinna na tan dia, ahihkeileh dangka talent khat na piak ding ahi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Kei na sikha ka pumbuai ziak in a na paimangta hi, a chi hi. Israel kumpipa’n a kiang ah, “Huchibang geih in na tung a thukhen ahi ding, nangmah in thukhen khin neive” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Aman a mai apan vut a la khezok a; Israel kumpipa’n zawlneite lak a mi ahi chih a theita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Aman a kiang ah, Toupa’n hichi in a chi. “Hihsiat gawp dia ka sehsa mi khat na paisak ziak in a hinna sik in nang hinna, a mite sik in na mite na tan ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Israel kumpipa bel nguitak leh lungkimlou tak in a pai a, Samaria khua a hongtungta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, huai thilte nung in hichi ahi a, Jezreel mi Naboth in grephuan a nei a, huai Jezreel ah Samaria kumpipa Ahab inn kiang ah a om ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ahab in Naboth kiang ah, “Ka inn kiang a om a hih ziak in anteh louhing huan din na grephuan honpia in. A sik in grephuan hoihzaw k’on pe ding. Ahihkeileh na deihzawk lelah a dangka in aman hun ding k’on pe ding” chi in a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Naboth in Ahab kiang ah, “Ka pu ka pate gou nang k’on pethei hetkei ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jezreel mi Naboth in huchibang thu a kiang a a gen ziak in Ahab ngui leh lungkimlou tak in a in ah a lut hi; ka pu ka pate gou k’on pe thei hetkei ding, a chi bikbek ngal a. Huchi in a lupna ah a lum a, khatlam a nga a, an a ne kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huchi in a zi Jezebel a vahoh a, a kiang ah, “Bangchidan ahia na lungsim huchitaka a lungkham a, an na neklouh?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aman a kiang ah, “Naboth kiang ah, Na grephuan hon leisak in, ahihkeileh na deihzawk leh a sik in grephuan dang k’on pe ding ka chi hi. Aman, ka grephuan zaw k’on pethei hetkei ding, chi’n a hon dawng a ahi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A zi Jezebel in a kiang ah, “Israel gam kumpipa na hi ka hia? Thou inla, an ne inla, lungsim nuamtak in om in. Jezreel mi Naboth grephuan ken k’on pe ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huchi in Ahab min in laithonte a gelh a, Ahab chiamtehna in a chiamteh hi. Hiai laithonte Naboth invengte a upate leh makaite kiang ah a khak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Laithonte ah, “An ngolh na phuang unla, mipi lak ah Naboth makai sak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Belial tate mi nih a ma ah tusak unla, Nang Pathian leh kumpipa na gensia hi, chi a amah hek ding mi a na bawl un. Huchi in amah paw khia unla, suang in a na denglum un” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A tenna khua a upate leh makaite’n Jezebel in a kiang ua a khak laithon a kigelh bang in a na hihta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />An ngolh a phuang ua, mipi lak ah Naboth a makai sak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Belial tate mi nih hongpai in a ma ah a va tu ua; Belial tate’n mipite ma ah, Naboth in Pathian leh kumpipa a gensia, chi in amah a hek uhi. Huchi in khua apan a pawkhia ua, suang in a deng ua, a sita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jezebel kiang ah, Naboth suang in a deng ua, a sita chih hilh din mi a sawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Jezebel in Naboth suang in a deng ua, a sita chih a zak in hichi ahi a, Jezebel in Ahab kiang ah, “Thou inla, Jezreel mi Naboth grephuan, a hon leisak phallouh neita aw le. Naboth a dam nawnta kei, a sita hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahab in Naboth a sita chih a zak in hichi ahi a; Jezreel mi Naboth grephuan nei dia kuansuk din Ahab a thouta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Toupa thu Tishbi mi Elijah kiang ah a hongtung a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Thou inla, Samaria khua a om Israel kumpipa houpih din hohsuk in. Ngai in, Naboth grephuan ah a om a, neihtum in huai ah a hohsuk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A kiang ah, Toupa’n hichi in a chi. ‘Na that a, na neihsak behlap lai maw? chi inla, a kiang ah, Toupa’n hichi in a chi, Ui in Naboth sisan a liahna mun mah ah nang sisan leng a liak ding uh’ ” na chi ding a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahab in Elijah kiang ah, “Na hong muta maw, ka melmapa?” a chi hi. Aman a dawng a, “Hon muta keive, Toupa’n mitmuh a thil hoihlou hihdia nang leh nang na kikhot khiattak ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ngai in na tung ah thil hoihlou ka tungsak dia, na suante ka lamang dia, Ahab apan a ta pasal taphot Israel gam a mi zalen hi in zalen lou hita leh ka satkhe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nang n’on hehsak ziak in leh Israelte thil na hih khelhsak ziak in Nebat tapa Jeroboam inkawte leh Ahijah tapa Baasha inkawte bang mai in na inkawte ka bawl ding, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Jezebel tungtang thu leng Toupa’n a gen a, Jezebel khaw kulh chin ah uite’n a ne ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ahab inkawte lak a mi khopi a si peuhmah uite’n a ne ding ua; gam a si peuhmahte tung a leng vasate’n a ne ding uh” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A zi Jezebel tohthoh a Toupa mitmuh a thil hoihlou hihdia amah leh amah kikhawng khia Ahab bang mi kuamah a omkei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Toupa’n Israel suante ma a delhkhiaksa Amorte thilhih chi teng bang in milimte bia in thil kihhuaitak a hih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ahab in huai thu a zak in hichi ahi a, a puan a botkek a, saiip puan a silh hi. An a ngawl a, saiip puan ah a lum a, kidawmtak in a pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Toupa thu Tishbi mi Elijah kiang ah a hongtung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Ka ma a Ahab a kiniamkhiak dan na mu hia? A kiniamkhiat ziak in a damsung in hiai thil hoihlou ka tungsak kei dia, a tapa damsung in bel a inkawte tung ah hiai thil hoihlou ka tungsak ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, kum thum sung Suriate leh Israelte kidou lou in a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A kum thum kum in hichi ahi a, Judah kumpipa Jehosaphat Israel kumpipa kiang ah a hohsuk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel kumpipa’n a sikhate kiang ah, “Ramoth a Gilead khua ei a ahi chih thei napi a, bangchidan a Suria kumpipa khut apan sutkhelou a mawk om ihi ua oi?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jehosaphat kiang ah, “Ramoth a Gilead ah galdou din kei toh n’ong kuan diam?” a chi hi. Jehosaphat in Israel kumpipa kiang ah, “Kei leh nang, ka mite leh na mite pumkhat i hi ua, ka sakol leh na sakol pumkhat ahi ve ua le” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jehosaphat in Israel kumpipa kiang ah, “Tuni in Toupa thu dong in” chi in k’on ngen, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huchi in Israel kumpipa’n zawlnei mi za li a samkhawm a, a kiang uah, “Ramoth a Gilead khua dou din ka kuantou diam, kuantou lou ding?” a chi hi. Amau, “Kuan in, Toupa’n kumpipa khut ah a honpe ding” a chi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Himahleh Jehosaphat in “Hiai ah Toupa zawlnei dang kuahiam bek i dot ding omlou hia?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Israel kumpipa’n Jehosaphat kiang ah, “ Toupa hon dotsak ding mi khat Imlah tapa Mikaiah omlai veh aw. Himahleh amah ka hua hi; ka tungtang thu a hoihlou lam loungal a hoihlam a gen ngeikei” a chi hi. Jehosaphat in “Kumpipa’n hichibang in chi kei hen” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huchi in Israel kumpipa’n heutu khat a sam a, “Imlah tapa Mikaiah kintak in vapi mahdih” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Israel kumpipa leh Judah kumpipa Jehosaphat bel Samaria kongpi lutna gei phaizang ah a kumpipa uh puan a kithuam in a mangtutphah tuaktuak uah a tu uh. zawlnei tengteng in a ma uah thu a gen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kenanah tapa Zedekiah in sik kite a bawlsak a, Toupa’n hichi in a chi, “Hiaite in Suriate mangthang sipsip khop in na hihse ding chi’n,” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huchi mah bang in zawlnei tengteng in “Ramoth a Gilead khua ah va hohtou inla, va lohching in, Toupa’n kumpipa khut ah a honpe ding” chi’n a gen uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mikaiah sam dia sawl a ompan a kiang ah, “Ngai dih, zawlneite’n thukhatsat in a hoihlam in kumpipa kiang ah thu a genchiat uh. A gen khitsa bang un gensam inla, a hoihlam in vagen in” chi’n a ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mikaiah in, “ Toupa hinna lou in ka gen hi, Toupa’n ka kiang ah a genmah ka vagen ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kumpipa kiang a tun touh in, kumpipa’n a kiang ah, “Mikaiah, Ramoth a Gilead khua dou din ka kuantou diam, kuantou lou ding?” a chi hi. Aman a dawng a, “Kuantou inla, va lohching in; Toupa’n kumpipa khut ah a honpe ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kumpipa’n a kiang ah, “Thutak kia loungal ka kiang a Toupa min a genlou dia bangzah vei ahia k’on ki chiamsak ding?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aman, “Israel tengteng ching ding neilou belam bang in tang a dalhzak in ka mu hi. Toupa’n , hiaite’n heutu a neita kei ua, michih a ma in ah lungmuangtak in pai uhen a chi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Israel kumpipa’n Jehosaphat kiang ah, “Ka tungtang thu a hoihlou lam kia loungal a hoihlam himhim a gen kei ding chih k’on hilh ahi kei maw?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aman “Huaiziak in, Toupa thu ngaikhe dih, Toupa a mangtutphah tung a tu, van a mipi tengteng a taklam leh veilam a dingte toh ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Toupa’n, Ramoth a Gilead khua a hohtou a, gal a si dia kuan Ahab kunzou ding ahia? a chi hi. Khat in hichibang in, midang in huchibang in, a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huchi in kha khat a hongpawt a, Toupa ma ah ading a, ken ka kunzou ding, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Toupa’n a kiang ah, Bang in eita? a chi hi. Aman ka vahoh dia, a zawlnei teng muk ah kha zuauthei ka vasuak ding a chi hi. Aman va kun mah inla, na lohching lai ding. Va kuan inla, huchibang in va hih veleh, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Huaiziak in, tuin ngai in, Toupa’n hiai na zawlnei teng muk ah kha zuauthei a koih a, na tungtang thu a hoihlou lam Toupa’n a genkhinta” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Huchi in Kenanah tapa Zedekiah in a honnaih a, Mikaiah biang a hong beng a, “ Toupa Kha in na kiang a thugen din kei apan koilam ah ahia a pai?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mikaiah in “Ngai in, dantan sunggil a kibu dia na lut ni’n na thei ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Israel kumpipa’n, “Mikaiah pi unla, khopi ukpipa Ammon leh kumpi tapa Joash kiang ah paipih nawn un” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Kumpipa’n hichi in a chi, “Hiai mi suangkulh ah khum unla, galmuanga k’ong pai nawn masiah gimthuakna an leh gimthuakna tui na pia un” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Mikaiah in “Galmuanga na hongpai nawn leh Toupa’n kei zang a thu genlou ahi ding” a chi hi. Amahmah in, “Nou, mipite aw, na vek un na za un,” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Huchi in Israel kumpipa leh Jehosaphat Ramoth a Gilead khua ah a hohtou uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Israel kumpipa’n Jehosaphat kiang ah, “Ka kibawl lamdang dia, kidouna ah ka hohtou dia; nang bel na kumpi puansilh in” a chi hi. Huchi in Israel kumpipa a kibawl lamdang a, kidouna ah a hohtou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Suria kumpipa’n a kangtalai tung a heutu sawmthum leh nih te kiang ah, “Israel kumpipa kia loungal mi neu leng, mi lian leng a kuamah sual kei un” chi’n thu a pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Kangtalai tung a heutute’n Jehosaphat a muh un, hichi ahi a, “Israel kumpipa ahimah ve” a chi uh. Huchi in sual tum in a umta ua; Jehosaphat a kikoukhia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Kangtalai tung a heutute’n Israel kumpipa a na hi kei chih a theih un hichi ahi a, a delhlai uh a nungkiksan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Mi khat in tup tuam neilou in a thalpeu a lai a, Israel kumpipa kithopna kikal tak ah a kap khat a hi. Huchi in a kangtalai hawlpa kiang ah, “Kaihei inla, sepaihte lak apan hon pawtpih in, ka liam hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Huai ni’n kidouna a thupi mahmah a; kumpipa a kangtalai tung a kingai in Suriate lamnga in a opsuk a, nitaklam in a sita a; a liamna apan sisan kangtalai sung ah a luang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Nitum kuan in sepaihte lak ah, “Michih amah khua ah, michih amah gam ah paivek hen” chi’n thu puankhiat ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Huchi in kumpipa a sita a, Samaria khua a lutpih ua; huchi in Samaria khua ah kumpipa a vuita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Samaria khua dil khat ah kangtalai a sil ua; Toupa thugen bang in uite’n a sisan a liaksiang ua, a galvan leng a sil siang uh. Huai dil bel kizuakte kisilna dil ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Huchi in Ahab tanchin dangte, a thilhih tengteng, saiha inn a lamte, a khosat tengteng Israel kumpipate lal lai thugelhna bu ah a tuang kei maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Huchi in Ahab a pute kiang ah a ihmuta a; a tapa Ahaziah a sik in a hong lalta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Israel kumpipa Ahab lal kum lina ah Asa tapa Jehosaphat Judahte tung ah a lal pan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Jehosaphat a lal kipat in kum sawmthum leh nga ahi a; Jerusalem khua ah kum sawmnih leh nga vai a hawm hi. A nu min Azubah ahi a, amah Shilhi tanu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />A pa Asa lampi tot tengteng a tawn a; pialsan hetlou in Toupa mitmuh in thil hoih a hih hi. Himahleh munsangte a lamang kei a, mun sangte ah mite kithoih lai in gimlim a hallai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Jehosaphat in Israel kumpipa toh kilemna a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Huchi in Jehosaphat tanchin dangte, a thilhih theihdan a hih lat thute, a galdou thute Judah kumpipate lal lai thugelhna bu ah a tuang kei maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />A pa Asa damlai a pasal kizuak omlaite a gam apan a delh khe vek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Edom gam ah kumpipa a omkei a, thuneihna piaksawn mi khat in vai a hawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Jehosaphat in Ophir a pai a dangkaeng paw ding Tarsis longte a bawl hi. Himahleh Ezion-geber mun ah longte a siat khitvek ziak in a hohta kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Huchi in Ahab tapa Ahaziah in Jehosaphat kiang ah, ka sikhate na sikhate toh longte ah kuankhawm le uh ake, a chi a; himahleh Jehosaphat in lem a sa kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Huchi in Jehosaphat a pute kiang ah a ihmuta a, a pute lak ah a pu David khopi ah a vui ua; a tapa Jehoram a sik in a lalta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Judah kumpipa Jehosaphat lal kum sawmlehsagih kum in Ahab tapa Ahaziah Samaria ah Israelte tung ah a lal pan a, Israelte tung ah kum nih a lal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Toupa mitmuh in thil hoihlou a hih a, a nu leh a pa lampi totte, Nebat tapa Israelte thil hihkhial sakpa Jeroboam lampi totte a tawn sam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />A pa hihteng hih in Baal na a sem a, a bia a, Toupa , Israelte Pathian a hehsak hi.
  </para>
</usx>
